&lt;li&gt;Work with multi-functional project teams on solution architecture options for design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all work meets quality, operational, and architectural standards needed for organizational success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team’s YBIYRI model (you-build-it-you-run-it), which includes participating in their on-call pager rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
