&lt;li&gt;Hands-on approach and ready to deep dive into code details with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, coordination and influencing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, deep knowledge and experience with Microsoft languages/frameworks (C#/.NET, SQL Server, Entity Framework)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with Azure (Function Apps, Service Bus, etc...) a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
