&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science or related followed by 2 years of Software Engineering experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position also requires the following:&lt;/p&gt;
