&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8131201:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The People team&#39;s mission is to build the systems, programs, and culture that enable Robinhood&#39;s employees to do the best work of their careers. We attract, develop, and retain exceptional talent — and design the programs that support people from their first day through every stage of their journey. We partner closely across the business to ensure our people strategy moves as fast as the company does. We&#39;re building something special, and we take that responsibility seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Benefits, you&#39;ll own the strategy, design, and delivery of benefit programs that serve Robinhood&#39;s global workforce. You&#39;ll define our benefits philosophy from first principles — not defaulting to market convention, but building programs that genuinely help us attract and retain the best talent in the world, reinforce our high-performance culture, and deliver an outstanding employee experience. You&#39;ll lead a team, own key vendor relationships, partner with Legal and Finance, and bring your expertise to bear on everything from annual renewals to M&amp;amp;A due diligence. This is a high-visibility, high-impact role where you&#39;ll shape how thousands of employees experience Robinhood every day!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Chicago, IL, Menlo Park, CA, and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected 5 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve Robinhood&#39;s global benefits philosophy and strategy, starting from first principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and manage programs across health, welfare, retirement, leave, and voluntary benefits for a global workforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, streamline, and automate benefits processes with a constant focus on employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead annual program reviews and renewals, including vendor negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market practices and the regulatory landscape to keep our programs competitive and compliant across all jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal and Finance on compliance and regulatory obligations across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead benefits due diligence and integration for M&amp;amp;A activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, develop, and lead a high-performing benefits team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in benefits, with a track record of designing and implementing global programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across health, welfare, retirement, and leave – both US and international&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A first-principles approach to designing programs, processes, and policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and comfort modeling program costs, utilization, and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency with AI tools, with curiosity to experiment, learn, and incorporate new tools and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A experience including benefits due diligence and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of regulatory and compliance requirements across global jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving process improvement and automation without sacrificing the employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills, and ability to present complex topics clearly to employees and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership expectations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambitious roadmap requires a great culture shaped by exceptional leaders. Here’s what we expect from them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high performance by setting clear, focused goals, giving real-time feedback, stretching top talent, and scaling impact through focus, innovation, and tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and retain top talent by setting a high bar, hiring only those who raise it, investing in onboarding, and addressing talent issues quickly and fairly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create community by connecting work to purpose, removing friction while prioritizing safety, building trust and inclusion, and leading from the front with integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet — a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$198,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$233,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$207,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8131316:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Chief of Staff to the CHRO, you&#39;ll serve as a force multiplier for the People organization&#39;s most senior leader, ensuring priorities are advanced, time is focused on the highest-impact areas, and voice is amplified internally and externally. You&#39;ll own the operating rhythm for the People leadership team and lead critical initiatives from conception through execution, proactively resolving problems before they reach the CHRO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the CHRO&#39;s operating cadence by managing weekly and quarterly leadership meetings, setting clear agendas, driving decisions, and ensuring follow-ups are completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead critical cross-functional initiatives and engagements on behalf of the CHRO, acting as her stand-in when needed in key meetings and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling content and narratives including meeting decks, org-wide emails, social media posts, and speaking engagement materials that amplify the CHRO&#39;s voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and resolve issues before they escalate, synthesizing ambiguity into clear recommendations for executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the CHRO&#39;s interests and point of view across the organization, ensuring alignment and advancing People team priorities with cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience, including management consulting, business operations, strategy, or a chief of staff capacity supporting senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to synthesize ambiguous, complex topics into clear executive-ready recommendations, narratives, and communications across formats (decks, emails, social content).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving cross-functional initiatives end-to-end, managing multiple workstreams simultaneously with clear accountability and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of crypto or demonstrated enthusiasm for the space with willingness to immerse yourself in the ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,330&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$249,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
