&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on creation, optimization, and scaling of performance marketing campaigns across Google, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), Apple Search Ads (ASA), TikTok Ads and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentlessly focus on maximizing Return on Ad Spend (ROAS) and achieving efficient mobile user acquisition targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the expert user for our Mobile Measurement Partner, AppsFlyer, ensuring data integrity and accurate attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the creative process by briefing design/creative teams and generating/validating effective ad copy and video scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize expertise in AI tools for copy creation, campaign optimization, and strategic performance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of mobile ad fraud (click injection, SDK spoofing) and prevention tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to self-serve data via SQL/Looker/Tableau to reduce dependency on data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Performance/Growth Marketing, specifically focused on Mobile App Growth (UA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert working knowledge of AppsFlyer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in ROAS-focused campaign optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing monthly budgets exceeding USD 300k.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive, hands-on experience managing Google, Meta, ASA, and TikTok campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in professional and technical English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Crypto, Fintech or Gaming industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing products in the Cryptocurrency space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION &amp;amp; PERKS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time salary based on experience and meaningful equity in an industry-leading company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role based in our Singapore office, with a mandatory in-office presence four days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Anywhere Policy: You can work remotely from anywhere in the world for up to 20 days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgets for learning &amp;amp; professional development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy; work hard and take time when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apple equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to be a key player and build your career at a rapidly expanding, global technology company in an emerging field&lt;/li&gt;
