&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities: &lt;/strong&gt;Client Coverage &amp;amp; Engagement, Account Growth &amp;amp; Expansion, Driving Operational Excellence, AI-Powered Scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Coverage &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for a growing portfolio of institutional clients across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain account growth plans covering each client&#39;s business model, strategic priorities, and growth potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive proactive engagement across the book, ensuring every APAC client has a high-quality relationship with OpenFX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand each client&#39;s business to uncover opportunities and strengthen the relationship over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Growth &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze client data to identify opportunities for volume growth and increased product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies that grow transaction volume by helping clients optimize their FX flows and deepen their activity on our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the cross-sell pipeline independently, driving&amp;nbsp; adoption for new currency pairs and products&amp;nbsp; as they launch globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a structured management framework for long tail accounts, ensuring consistent coverage and early identification of growth and retention risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor client health metrics across the book, using data to identify risks and act proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Product and Ops to resolve client issues promptly and channel structured feedback into product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered&amp;nbsp; Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI as a core part of day to day tasks, automating routine workflows, deepening client insights, and creating capacity for higher-value client interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement AI-forward practices that raise the bar for how the Client Success team operates, setting a new gold standard for the function globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in fintech or financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of total professional experience across account management, sales, consulting, and business operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to use data to understand client health, identify patterns, and surface risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced fluency with AI tools, applied as a core part of how you work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage a book of clients independently, with full ownership of outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What helps you stand out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in cross-border payment businesses such as remittance companies, PSPs, neobanks, or payment infrastructure companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of FX markets and trading operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in B2B client success or sales with exposure to account management or sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level Mandarin proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity in a rapidly growing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work in a fast-paced startup at the forefront of fintech innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to make a significant impact on global financial infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative work culture with emphasis on personal and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

