&lt;p&gt;We’re building the Port City of AI, in which millions of individuals, third party apps, and AI agents gather, interact, and access sophisticated AI resources on a private and permissive foundation.&amp;nbsp; Our mission is to make artificial intelligence approachable and useful in everyday work—bridging the gap between cutting-edge research and practical, real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a fast-moving startup where every team member is expected to make a clear impact. Our culture is rooted in curiosity, ownership, ethical principle, philosophy, and collaboration—whether we’re designing better AI workflows, supporting our growing community, or shaping the future of human-AI interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Venice AI means joining a team of unorthodox builders who believe in moving quickly, delivering a beautiful mass-marketand highly useful consumer product that doesn’t spy on people or censor their ideas and questions., and maintaining an edge in the rapidly evolving world of agentic machine intelligence. If you’re energized by big ideas, entrepreneurial spirit, individual empowerment, and the opportunity to help shape a fast-growing company in the world’s hottest industry from the ground up, please reach out.you’ll feel right at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we are hiring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venice is taking on the global market as the only AI infrastructure provider that prioritizes the privacy and personal sovereignty of users’ personal data. As we move into scaling mode, we need to ensure that our employees and infrastructure are as secure as our customers. This is an opportunity for you to be on the bleeding edge of privacy-focused AI with a unique and dedicated team of high-agency individuals doing truly novel work. You’ll be instrumental in helping Venice achieve and maintain inertia as a force of nature in the space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design, build, and maintain cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage networking across cloud and on-premises environments, including routing, peering, firewalls, VLANs, VPNs, and load balancing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain assets using Infrastructure as Code pipelinesBuild and maintain CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate provisioning, configuration management, and operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect highly available, secure, and scalable cloud environmentsImprove observability, monitoring, logging, alerting, and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with software engineering teams to improve developer experience and platform reliabilityWork with the Security team to develop and Implement security best practices, identity management, secrets management, and least-privilege access in a very high operational security environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve infrastructure through automation and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional history in network administration, and/or relevant certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of infrastructure, platform engineering, DevOps, or SRE experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cloud platform environments (AWS, GCP, Azure, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Infrastructure as Code to version-control networking and cloud platform assets (Pulumi, Terraform, Ansible, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building CI/CD pipelines (CircleCI, GitHub Actions, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux systems administration experience (performance tuning, kernel optimizations, security hardening)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with scripting or programming languages (TypeScript, Golang, Rust)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating production Kubernetes environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud security principles and IAM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing resilient, highly available distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

89052142:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Web3 Product Manager – Crypto Launch &amp;amp; AI-Driven Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Abu Dhabi （need relocation）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chinese Language Skill is a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager with deep expertise in trading system architecture, order matching logic, user experience, and onchain assets. The ideal candidate is also forward-thinking and genuinely passionate about the tokenization of financial assets, including Tokenized Stocks, Pre-IPO, RWA Yield, and other onchain innovations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trading Product Design &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning, design, and ongoing iteration of spot trading products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end implementation of new trading features, continuously enhancing the user trading experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and drive the design and application of AI-powered trading tools (e.g., smart order routing, assisted market analysis).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of core trading system logic, including order matching, order state flows, and market depth management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CeDeFi &amp;amp; RWA Innovation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the strategic direction for spot onchain business, bringing DeFi innovations into the centralized exchange environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the launch of CeDeFi products, bridging onchain and offchain trading experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead productization efforts for emerging asset classes such as RWA, Tokenized Stocks, Pre-IPO, and onchain yield products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in trading product roles, with a solid understanding of spot/futures trading systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of order matching engines, trading workflows, and core trading system logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product design skills, with proven ability to drive 0-to-1 product planning and execution independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the crypto asset market and a consistent track record of staying up to date with industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building onchain trading platforms or composing DeFi protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience or in-depth research in RWA, tokenized stocks, or onchain yield products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exploring AI applications in trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with major public blockchain ecosystems and smart contract interaction logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

