&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Eliminate single-point personnel risk: at least 2 people can handle each core system independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Echelon Construction: Cultivate 2-3 senior SREs who can independently be responsible for Line of Business reliability&lt;/li&gt;
