&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Testing Tasks:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform functional testing, regression testing, and API testing to ensure product quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Environment &amp;amp; Data Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain testing environments; manage test data; submit and track bugs; and assist developers in locating and reproducing issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarize yourself with R&amp;amp;D testing workflows; learn and master the company’s business logic and internal testing protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Programming Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in at least one programming language (Python, Java, Go, or C++); capable of writing basic scripts and performing API testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluent Mandarin &amp;amp; English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Testing Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of R&amp;amp;D testing workflows and software testing theory (e.g., test design methodology, boundary value analysis, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Sensitivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Keen insight into system design and implementation; ability to provide constructive suggestions for product optimization and user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/strong&gt; or a strong interest in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Web3 and Blockchain&lt;/strong&gt; technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
