&lt;li&gt;Our salaries are competitive and calculated using a transparent formula.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer generous health insurance for yourself and your dependents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working parents - we offer generous parental leave policies (26 weeks for mothers and 4 weeks for fathers) and subsidized childcare when you return to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We help you live your fullest life now! We subsidize gym memberships and fitness classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Airtime reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free food and a beautiful office space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Statistics, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8+ years of relevant marketing experience, with a track record that spans both analytical and strategic work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and analytical skills: able to work with BI tools and dashboards, extract and interpret marketing data independently, and build clear, evidence-based recommendations. Comfortable with numbers — this is non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing market research initiatives: able to design research briefs, select and manage external agencies, and synthesise findings into strategic insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing sponsorship or brand partnership portfolios — from identifying opportunities and negotiating terms to activating and measuring impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of how to extract ATL and BTL value from sponsorships: media visibility, on-ground activation, audience engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work cross-functionally in a complex organisation — confident collaborating with global and local teams and clear about where own remit begins and ends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management skills: able to handle multiple workstreams simultaneously with rigour and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills: able to present data and insights in a way that is clear, compelling, and drives decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with external agencies and research suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
