&lt;li&gt;Are equally strong in a spreadsheet and in a partnership negotiation, you don&#39;t see those as separate worlds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to commission and challenge research: you don&#39;t just accept what an agency delivers, you push for rigour and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable owning your scope as an individual contributor , you don&#39;t need a team below you to deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in mobile money, fintech, telecom, FMCG, or a strategy/research consultancy with a strong West Africa practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are organised, precise, and thrive in an environment that moves fast and values evidence over instinct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a collaborative partner who knows how to work with global teams while staying grounded in local realities.&lt;/li&gt;
