&lt;li&gt;Develop strategies to boost the retention of newly acquired users.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, train, and manage distribution team members, and build systems to rapidly scale distribution as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the roadmap for the distribution team in your area to achieve its quarterly key objectives, including iterating on strategy and growing our customer base day after day within the assigned region of Sierra Leone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to inform distribution strategies and monitor your team&#39;s performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the agency team to align key objectives and operationalize strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to develop Wave’s distribution strategy by sharing insights and learning from the team’s experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
