&lt;div&gt;Proficient in data analysis and visualization tools (e.g., Excel, SQL, Python).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNhgdbsrooULTLxT352ua5Ydsof&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9XYdyvlsopyOWxKzbWuUbULsvg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
