&lt;p&gt;We are a small team of exceptional engineers with broad ownership and a high bar for craft, judgment, and execution. We turn complexity across compliance systems, backend services, smart contracts, and external partners into products that feel clear and dependable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering on this team is distinguished by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product taste.&lt;/strong&gt; We simplify complex financial workflows without hiding the details that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers shape, build, launch, and improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed with confidence.&lt;/strong&gt; We scope sharply, move quickly, and hold a high quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and correctness.&lt;/strong&gt; Access control, auditability, privacy, and failure behavior are design constraints from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency and low ego.&lt;/strong&gt; We act without waiting, invite direct critique, and make the team better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Full-Stack Engineer focused on Growth, you will design the foundations of how users discover, understand, adopt, and return to Ondo&#39;s products. You will own the systems and product experiences that turn user insight into measurable growth across acquisition, activation, engagement, and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your scope spans the full growth loop—from public websites and user-facing product journeys to experimentation, analytics, content systems, backend workflows, and third-party platforms. You will set technical direction, define the measurement foundations, and evolve these systems as our products, markets, and scale change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a foundational ownership role for a senior engineer. You will turn ambiguous growth opportunities into clear hypotheses, durable architecture, and polished product experiences. You will partner closely with Product, Design, Marketing, Data, and Engineering while owning the judgment: where friction matters, what to build, how to measure it, and when the evidence calls for a different direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is not experiment volume. It is to understand users better than anyone else and turn that understanding into durable product improvements and measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the growth engineering strategy across discovery, acquisition, activation, engagement, and retention—from identifying the highest-leverage opportunities through technical design, launch, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve the foundations for experimentation, event instrumentation, attribution, funnel analysis, content, and lifecycle experiences so the team can move quickly and trust what it learns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build polished user-facing experiences and the backend systems, data models, APIs, webhooks, and third-party integrations behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with users and product data to identify friction, form clear hypotheses, and make disciplined product and technical bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn validated learning into durable product capabilities and measurable business impact—not one-off experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Marketing, and Data to lead launches, localization, and new ways to grow adoption across Ondo&#39;s products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve organic discovery and conversion through technical SEO and AEO, performance, structured content, and clear user journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the level of the team through clear writing, thoughtful code review, strong operational ownership, and effective use of modern AI engineering tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience building and operating production full-stack applications with React, Next.js, and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving measurable acquisition, activation, engagement, or retention outcomes through growth engineering, product-led growth, consumer product, ecommerce, or similarly data-informed product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating serverless systems on AWS, including Lambda and adjacent services such as API Gateway, EventBridge, or SQS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using BigQuery and product analytics data to model funnels, investigate user behavior, and measure product and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals in API and data-model design, relational databases, event-driven systems, event instrumentation, experimentation, testing, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of owning product work end to end—not only implementing experiments or specifications handed to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product taste: you can find the simplest experience that solves the user&#39;s problem without ignoring the complexity or edge cases underneath it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data fluency and intellectual honesty. You can define useful metrics, distinguish signal from noise, and change direction when the evidence challenges your hypothesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to communicate clearly, learn unfamiliar domains quickly, and create alignment across engineering, product, design, marketing, and data partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency and low ego. You move important work forward, invite strong critique, and care more about the outcome than whose idea wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building fintech, trading, crypto-native, or other high-consideration products where earning user trust is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lifecycle marketing, CRM, CMS, experimentation, localization, or analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AEO, structured content, international SEO, and growth across multiple regions or languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI to prototyping, personalization, analytics, content operations, or other growth workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do not expect every strong candidate to arrive with deep crypto or every growth specialty listed above. We do expect curiosity, strong product and engineering fundamentals, and the ability to turn learning into shipped improvements quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work helping define how a global audience discovers and adopts a new category of financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation including salary, future token rights, and/or equity, according to your preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full medical, vision, and dental benefits, plus a flexible vacation policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment with meaningful autonomy and influence over product and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional colleagues from Goldman Sachs, BlackRock, Two Sigma, Bridgewater, SpaceX, AWS, Meta, Google, McKinsey, Coinbase, Circle, and Uniswap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backing from leading crypto experts and investors, including Pantera Capital, Founders Fund, and Coinbase Ventures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

89921426:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making Africa the first cashless continent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2017, over half the population in Sub-Saharan Africa had no bank account. That&#39;s for good reason—the fees are too high, the closest branch can be miles away, and nobody takes cards. Without access to financial institutions, people are forced to keep their savings under the mattress. Small business owners rely on lenders who charge extortionate rates. Parents spend hours waiting in line to pay school fees in cash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re solving this by building financial services that just work: no account fees, instantly available, and accepted everywhere. In places where electricity, water and roads don&#39;t always work, you can still send money with Wave. In 2017, we launched a mobile app in Senegal for cash deposit, withdrawal, and peer-to-peer and business payments. Now, we have millions of users across 9 countries and are growing fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to make Africa the first cashless continent and that&#39;s where you come in...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How you&#39;ll help us achieve it&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Field Auditor to monitor the facilities and activities of our premium agency network on an ongoing basis. You&#39;ll also be in charge of identifying weaknesses to help operational staff better prevent business risks and providing us with relevant data to help improve performance and achieve company targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to designated premium agencies regularly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out cash audits and report any shortcomings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out all controls outlined in the control plan and ensure everything is done properly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to updating the security risk map by sharing information about potential threats and vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to updating the operational risk map by providing information to ensure its accuracy and comprehensiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train cashiers on the procedures for their activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost fraud awareness among premium agent staff and premium cash officers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate operational and other incidents occurring in premium agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out end-of-year cash inventories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in risk analysis prior to the construction of any new premium agency or premium master agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in risk analyses for specific projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that premium agency staff comply with the code of conduct and management instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other administrative tasks may be assigned from time to time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Abengourou - You&#39;ll work in the field, visiting the network, and may travel to different locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work authorization in Côte d&#39;Ivoire is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a permanent position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salaries are competitive and calculated using a transparent formula.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer generous health insurance for yourself and your dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working parents - we offer 26 weeks of parental leave for mothers and 4 weeks for fathers, in addition to subsidized child care when they return to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Airtime reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free food and a beautiful office space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and good command of English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years University Level in Finance/Accounting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have dealt with high cash volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience assessing service quality or conducting surveys/data collection is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in the field - either in selling, communication, or distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in assessing service quality or conducting surveys/data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively and often, both in writing and speaking, to the point of over-communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are detail-oriented and seek to achieve excellence in everything you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adjust quickly to changing conditions in a professional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are great at data gathering, reporting, and analytics to draw insightful conclusions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adjust quickly to changing priorities and conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated with a focus on self-improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We have a rapidly growing in-country team in Senegal, Côte d&#39;Ivoire, Mali, Burkina Faso, The Gambia, Uganda, Niger, Sierra Leone, and Cameroon plus remote team members spread across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re deeply passionate about our mission of bringing radically affordable financial services to the people who need them most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We foster autonomy for our employees. You&#39;ll own your projects at every stage, from understanding the problem to monitoring your solution in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We raised the largest Series A in Africa in 2021. Our world-class investors, include Founders Fund, Sequoia Heritage, Stripe, Ribbit Capital, Y Combinator, and Partech Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are on&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies/revenue&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies/revenue&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Y Combinator&#39;s top companies by revenue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fill out the form below, and upload a resume in English and a&amp;nbsp;cover letter describing your interest in Wave and the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications frequently and recommend that you apply to the role that most closely aligns with your skills, experience and career goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wave is an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

90020653:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal;   font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal;  text-align: left;   white-space: normal;  word-spacing: 0px;  background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);    display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://base.org/&quot;&gt;Base&lt;/a&gt; is planning to bring a million developers and a billion users onchain. We need your help to make that happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Product Marketing Manager to own enterprise and B2B product marketing for &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.base.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Base&lt;/a&gt;, focused on financial markets. The Base Marketing team drives adoption of Base as the default chain for enterprises building onchain. You&#39;ll set the go-to-market strategy for institutional use cases, build the proof engine that turns enterprise wins into pipeline, and lead the launches that position Base as the infrastructure layer for onchain trading, lending, and tokenization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the enterprise GTM roadmap for Base financial markets, including positioning, messaging, segmentation, and launch strategy across institutional use cases (trading, lending, tokenization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a repeatable enterprise proof engine: written case studies, sales-enablement collateral, solution briefs, and flagship video content mapped to priority customer profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional launches with Product, BD, CDP, DevRel, Comms, Legal, and Compliance, translating complex and regulated capabilities into clear narratives for business buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive competitive and market intelligence for enterprise crypto, bringing the voice of the enterprise customer into the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and report the metrics that matter - pipeline influence, partner amplification, launch performance, and adoption - then optimize against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the working model for Base&#39;s enterprise marketing function and mentor junior PMMs as the team scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in product marketing or GTM roles with demonstrated B2B/enterprise outcomes, ideally in crypto and/or financial markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of owning end-to-end GTM and launches for technical financial products with measurable adoption or revenue results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with how onchain trading, lending, and tokenization work, and demonstrated ability to partner with Product and Engineering on roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven cross-functional leadership in 0-to-1 environments, with examples of stretching from strategy through hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing to financial institutions in regulated environments (e.g., MiCA, AML/CFT) or building/scaling a sales-enablement engine for a BD-led motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
