7907295003:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/crypto/#vertical-landing-staff&quot;&gt;team&lt;/a&gt; that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;a16z crypto aims to foster innovation, accelerate progress, and enable the crypto ecosystem to thrive in the U.S. — bringing the best of blockchains/crypto/decentralization to the world. (When we say “the best” of crypto, we mean the more &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/blockchain-culture-computer-vs-casino/&quot;&gt;productive, not purely speculative&lt;/a&gt;, uses of blockchains that can deliver on &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/read-write-own-intro/&quot;&gt;many benefits&lt;/a&gt; that people beyond the crypto industry want and need.) a16z crypto supports the crypto portfolio through engineering and security, go to market, regulatory and legal, research, talent and recruiting, as well as marketing — which includes an editorial content operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity at an established, prolific “direct media” operation — a model pioneered and proven by this team for over a decade at a16z — that has published influential industry reports, op-eds, builder playbooks, podcasts/videos, newsletters, and other content distributed on various platforms. The marketing team is composed of experienced brand marketers, top communications/ PR experts, designers, and editors coming from both established media outlets and in-house content marketing operations; the social media will cover all these marketing functions, while reporting into editorial.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Social Media Lead is responsible for growing a16z crypto’s social channels, including engaging key communities across different audiences relevant to our industry. They will work closely with the crypto marketing team to (1) adapt and distribute existing content pieces into social media posts; and (2) help create content native to social media: clips, content campaigns, and more. This spans everything from social media for external podcast appearances/media interviews to investment announcements; to events and major industry conferences; to editorial content; to special projects, campaigns, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This person will also advise the broader a16z crypto team (from investing to operations) — as well as our portfolio companies — in social media strategy and profile building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This is a remote role (including on West Coast time), though occasional in-office presence will be required for regular team offsites, occasional conferences/events, and based on business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and strategize. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re a doer who likes taking ideas to execution and is able to operationalize them into process, pipelines, and content calendars. But you’re not just good at the tactics: You’re also someone who is able to come up with fresh ideas — whether through collaboratively brainstorming with team members, proposing your own creative formats, or staying on top of the latest social media trends so you know which experiments to run and prioritize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze and optimize.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re data-driven, but also know how to trust your intuition and think big-picture. You (with us) will have hypotheses around content packages — and you will (working closely with our audience development lead) know how to test them, evaluate what’s working or not, and report back, so we build those learnings into our content programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and produce. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re able to directly create social content when needed, help produce it with others, and help oversee our short-form clips operation (leveraging our technical A/V editors and internal production person). This includes identifying, adapting, editing, and timing the right clips, so they’re compelling, engaging, and well-received on socials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plugged in online. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re on top of internet culture and the latest online conversations, monitor sentiment and “the current thing”, as well as track industry trends and shifts. You’re able to use this context to craft and tailor compelling, informative, and entertaining social media&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop community and voice.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re able to regularly engage with relevant social media communities and different audiences — as well as identify and engage key influencers across various crypto verticals/ domains. You would also be the online brand voice (and advocate for the industry) on behalf of a16z crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent communicator — whether through text, multimedia, design, or memes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience owning or driving social media for a high-visibility or high-growth brand — past experience embedded in a content operation is especially welcome&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to adapt style and voice across different formats, platforms, and audiences — able to be playful, thoughtful, smart, accessible, direct… all while striking the right tone (not corporate, not cringe)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with X, LinkedIn, Instagram, etc. required — and optionally, with crypto-native or alt social media tools and video (YouTube or TikTok)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong command of data — from implementing and using various analytics tools, to regularly interpreting and reporting insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to meet multi-threaded/ cross-functional deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Passionate about technology, the internet, open source, and/or crypto — intellectually curious and always learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate effectively with diverse teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $199,000 - $232,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

5387647008:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Technical Support Representative - Night Shift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Full-Time Temporary Position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are seeking an organized, efficient, and detail-oriented Technical Support Representative. The ideal candidate will possess strong technical expertise and the problem-solving skills necessary to provide effective support and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Provide comprehensive support, repair, and assistance to retail locations regarding POS software and hardware issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Repair and maintain equipment, including Point of Sale terminals, scanners/scales, printers, drawers, monitors, keyboards, and computers, along with their relevant software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Assist in the setup and installation of new hardware and POS-related software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Perform troubleshooting on core system remote devices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Engage in various computer-related break-fix repairs as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Effectively manage time, prioritize tasks, and work independently while maintaining strong communication with store staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Proven experience and knowledge in replacing, configuring, and setting up new hardware and software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Strong understanding of POS hardware (including all peripherals)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Proficient in electronic troubleshooting at the board level, with capabilities to repair terminals, computers, and peripherals at the component level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Proficient in networking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You need to have your own equipment that you can use, including dual monitors and a strong wired internet connection.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a motivated individual who thrives in a fast-paced environment and enjoys problem-solving, we invite you to apply for this exciting opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

5393706008:
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with the best&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Orderly, the ultimate destination for decentralized trading platforms. We are not satisfied with the limitations of centralized exchanges or the complexities of building decentralized order books. We aim to make trading easy, fast, and secure for everyone. How? By fusing the simplicity of CeFi with the power of DeFi.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At the heart of the issue lies “liquidity”. Builders often grapple with a paradox; traders need liquidity, but liquidity demands traders. Our solution is simple as is bold –&lt;span class=&quot;text-primary-100 font-semibold&quot;&gt;concentrate all liquidity into one order book. One order book that connects all the liquidity in the crypto space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our ambition doesn&#39;t stop there. We&#39;re omnichain, championing chain abstraction. We envision seamless transactions, where the underlying blockchain is merely a detail. By concentrating liquidity, we aim to redefine the crypto landscape, making bridging and wrapped assets a thing of the past.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are Orderly, and we are here to revolutionize DeFi, democratizing access to financial opportunities and fostering a fair, equitable paradigm for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Glimpse into Your Future at Orderly Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What will you achieve?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f7efhx&quot; data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1403&quot;&gt;Own and drive product strategy and initiatives across our DeFi and trading products, working closely with engineering, design, research, and other cross-functional teams to identify user needs and build best-in-class trading and developer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fbm23t&quot; data-start=&quot;1404&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Leverage your deep understanding of DeFi, crypto markets, and on-chain products to identify opportunities, validate product ideas, and translate market and user needs into impactful products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m6p02c&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering teams to understand technical constraints, identify bottlenecks, and make pragmatic trade-offs to ship high-quality products within time and resource constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f3shij&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1948&quot;&gt;Define clear product specifications, requirements, success metrics, and priorities, while maintaining a strong focus on execution and user impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;em9j4g&quot; data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;Use data, user feedback, and market insights to develop product strategies, evaluate opportunities, and drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6pv8vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2084&quot; data-end=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;Lead prioritization, risk analysis, resource allocation, and trade-offs across multiple initiatives, while aligning stakeholders around clear product goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v0p9jf&quot; data-start=&quot;2243&quot; data-end=&quot;2436&quot;&gt;Work closely with growth, marketing, and ecosystem teams to develop strategies that drive product adoption, market awareness, and engagement around the products and vision we’re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What challenges will you face?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1asskke&quot; data-start=&quot;2933&quot; data-end=&quot;3098&quot;&gt;A fast-moving and highly ambiguous market: DeFi and crypto markets evolve quickly, and you’ll often need to make product decisions with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g1dcut&quot; data-start=&quot;3099&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;Technical complexity: You’ll work closely with engineers and need to understand protocols, APIs, SDKs, smart contracts, on-chain data, liquidity, and trading mechanics well enough to make informed product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sxmz7e&quot; data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3496&quot;&gt;Complex product trade-offs: You’ll need to balance user needs, technical constraints, business goals, market dynamics, and protocol considerations when making decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19aplyz&quot; data-start=&quot;3497&quot; data-end=&quot;3685&quot;&gt;High ownership and autonomy: You’ll be expected to independently drive projects from problem discovery through launch and iteration, rather than simply executing an existing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ggpfh2&quot; data-start=&quot;3686&quot; data-end=&quot;3853&quot;&gt;Global collaboration: You’ll work with teammates across different countries, cultures, and time zones, requiring strong communication and self-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p5bhrb&quot; data-start=&quot;3854&quot; data-end=&quot;3916&quot;&gt;About you:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xo3alk&quot; data-start=&quot;4357&quot; data-end=&quot;4492&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with significant experience in DeFi, crypto, Web3, fintech, or financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e3bzmf&quot; data-start=&quot;4493&quot; data-end=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of DeFi protocols, crypto markets, on-chain trading, liquidity, and trading mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fr3r8x&quot; data-start=&quot;4605&quot; data-end=&quot;4760&quot;&gt;Proven track record of owning and shipping products end-to-end, from identifying opportunities and defining product strategy to launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v1gxhb&quot; data-start=&quot;4761&quot; data-end=&quot;4887&quot;&gt;Strong product sense and the ability to turn complex technical or market problems into simple, actionable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lxi30e&quot; data-start=&quot;4888&quot; data-end=&quot;4988&quot;&gt;Comfortable working closely with engineers and understanding technical constraints and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mnqi42&quot; data-start=&quot;4989&quot; data-end=&quot;5091&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to use data and user insights to drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dzwg8c&quot; data-start=&quot;5092&quot; data-end=&quot;5166&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18abvyo&quot; data-start=&quot;5167&quot; data-end=&quot;5232&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills in both English and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mh5naj&quot; data-start=&quot;5233&quot; data-end=&quot;5341&quot;&gt;High level of ownership, curiosity, and the ability to operate independently in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in Learning More?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our hiring process begins by meeting with our People Team, who help facilitate the process of placing you in your new role. You can expect to share your experience and ideas in online video interviews with our hiring team of management and potential new colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you have experience in developing trading systems or financial-related products is a&amp;nbsp;plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can prepare for this interview by mentally organizing your strategies and opinions on topics such as Web3, cryptocurrency trading platforms, and your vision of how to succeed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share this! Don’t be afraid of friends or co-workers stealing this job! We will find a place for you if you are unique and intelligent. Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://boards.greenhouse.io/orderlynetwork/jobs/5170520003&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;External Referral Incentives Program&lt;/a&gt; as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

4724710005:
&lt;p&gt;At Shakepay, we’re on a mission to usher in the bitcoin golden age. We’re reimagining financial services to give every Canadian their fair shake.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our culture is built around doing work that matters, winning as a team, and celebrating success. If you&#39;re the kind of person who values growth, shipping fast, and sharing your ideas openly with a group of like-minded people, come and build with us!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Shakepay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, we&#39;ve been on a mission to help Canadians build long-term wealth through bitcoin. Over the past few years, we&#39;ve expanded beyond buying and selling bitcoin to offer a growing suite of everyday financial products - including the Shakepay Card, direct deposit, bill payments and Interac e-Transfer - making it easier to earn, save and use bitcoin every day. Today, more than 1.5 million Canadians use Shakepay to grow their bitcoin savings and take control of their financial future as we continue to push the boundaries of what modern financial services can look like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re regulated as an investment dealer across all Canadian provinces and territories, and backed by renowned venture capitalists with a funding of $44M. We have a passionate, loyal, and growing community, and we’re looking for people who want to help us build something truly special.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform team empowers other engineering teams at Shakepay by providing the tools, infrastructure, and best practices they need to be autonomous, productive, and reliable. As the Platform Engineering Manager, you’ll ensure we balance fast delivery with operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Engineering Manager to lead and grow a team of platform engineers with a focus on Infrastructure, SRE and DevOps .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for people leadership, technical direction, and delivery across platform initiatives that impact every engineering team at Shakepay. You’ll partner closely with Engineers, Engineering leaders, Security, and Compliance, and lead by example, staying hands-on where it matters to shape technical decisions, support delivery, and ensure our platform evolves in step with both developer and business needs.&amp;nbsp;You’ll also play a key role in developing an agentic layer of the platform, building intelligent tooling and agentic workflows that automate repetitive work, assist engineers in complex tasks, and enable teams across the company to interact with systems and data in new ways&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the deepest expert in every area, but you must be technically strong enough to set direction, challenge assumptions, and make tradeoffs across DevEx, infrastructure, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a team of platform engineers across Infrastructure, DevOps and Developer Experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for platform architecture and ensure roadmap execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term delivery with long-term investments in tooling, infrastructure, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee cloud infrastructure, deployment pipelines, and operational tooling in a regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build AI-powered internal tools and agentic workflows that automate tasks and augment engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve developer productivity by reducing friction in onboarding, CI/CD, and local-to-prod workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure systems are secure, scalable, observable, and resilient as Shakepay grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own incident management practices, postmortems, and sustainability of the on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product engineering, security, and compliance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for platform work by tying technical initiatives to business and customer impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in platform, infrastructure, DevOps or SRE roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing and growing high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technologies like Kubernetes, AWS, Terraform, ArgoCD, Datadog, PostgreSQL, CI/CD tooling, and GitOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating production systems and supporting on-call rotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set technical direction across both developer experience and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with a focus on business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools in your day-to-day workflow to accelerate development, debugging, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech or other regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a Staff or Senior Engineer before moving into management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in Bitcoin and excitement to learn more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the future of money: &lt;/strong&gt;Be part of a team that&#39;s revolutionizing financial services in Canada, one sat at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact millions: &lt;/strong&gt;As cryptocurrency continues to gain traction, our potential for growth is massive. You can help us bring Shakepay and Bitcoin to all Canadians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your career: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re growing, and so can you! We have programs in place to encourage continuous learning, growth, and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas, not titles: &lt;/strong&gt;We want the best ideas to make their way through, no matter where they come from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤖 Generous AI token budget (currently unlimited)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Stock options as part of their total compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🦷 Full health and dental benefits, including a separate budget to take care of your mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Remote-friendly: Work from anywhere in Canada, with optional access to our office spaces in Montreal and Toronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🆙 A $2,000 annual budget for courses, certifications, and training to support your career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴&amp;nbsp; 20 days of vacation per year. And if you use all your vacation, we give you a $1,000 bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐣 Parental leave top up to 100% of your salary for 18 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🙌 Quarterly team-specific or company-wide offsite to connect with each other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;he base salary range for this position is $230,000 - 280,000 CAD. Base pay may vary based on factors such as years of experience, skills and qualifications. Additionally, employees are eligible for equity,&amp;nbsp; pay increases based on performance, benefits including health and dental care, and paid time off. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand that potential can be just as valuable as experience. If you&#39;re eager to learn, grow, and contribute to the mission but worry that you may not have the “right” experience, we still want you to apply.&amp;nbsp;We encourage applications from everyone, regardless of background and life experience. We’re firm believers that &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/gtallen1187/e83ed02eac6cc8d7e185&quot;&gt;a little bit of slope makes up for a lot of y-intercept&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluency in English is required due to the percentage of English-speaking customers and the nature of our platform, which is available to all Canadians.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We use technology, including artificial intelligence (AI), to support certain parts of our hiring process. This can include tools that assist with scheduling, application review, candidate communications, and generating interview notes, guides, or summaries so our team can stay focused on the conversation. All hiring decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

4723803005:
&lt;p&gt;At Shakepay, we’re on a mission to usher in the Bitcoin golden age. We’re reimagining financial services to give every Canadian their fair shake.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our culture is built around doing work that matters, winning as a team, and celebrating success. If you&#39;re the kind of person who values growth, shipping fast, and sharing your ideas openly with a group of like-minded people, come and build with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Shakepay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, we&#39;ve been on a mission to help Canadians build long-term wealth through bitcoin. Over the past few years, we&#39;ve expanded beyond buying and selling bitcoin to offer a growing suite of everyday financial products - including the Shakepay Card, direct deposit, bill payments and Interac e-Transfer - making it easier to earn, save and use bitcoin every day. Today, more than 1.5 million Canadians use Shakepay to grow their bitcoin savings and take control of their financial future as we continue to push the boundaries of what modern financial services can look like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re regulated as an investment dealer across all Canadian provinces and territories, and backed by renowned venture capitalists with a funding of $44M. We have a passionate, loyal, and growing community, and we’re looking for people who want to help us build something truly special.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Data Scientist, Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Data Scientist to join one of our cross-functional squads at Shakepay. You’ll work closely with engineering and design, while also partnering across marketing, finance, and operations to help us identify growth opportunities and make smarter decisions across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-moving environments, enjoys operating with high autonomy, and can turn ambiguous problems into measurable impact. You’ll combine experimentation, statistical rigor, business intuition, and product thinking to influence how we grow, retain, and better serve millions of Canadians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineers and designers across our product squads to improve acquisition, activation, retention, monetization, and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with marketing, finance, and operations teams to uncover growth opportunities and drive better business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and evangelize experimentation and decision frameworks that&amp;nbsp; help us ship and iterate quickly with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define KPIs and success metrics that&amp;nbsp; help teams stay aligned around measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use statistical analysis, forecasting, causal inference, and machine learning techniques to better understand user behavior and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-leverage opportunities proactively through deep analysis of user journeys, lifecycle behavior, conversion funnels, and financial performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape squad and company priorities by bringing data-informed perspectives on impact, tradeoffs, and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards, models, and self-serve tools that improve visibility into growth and business performance across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the broader data team to maintain a shared and consistent data layer that serves our stakeholders and internal agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of experimentation, curiosity, and evidence-based decision-making across Shakepay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in data science, growth analytics, experimentation, or related roles in high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of experimentation, causal inference, statistical analysis, forecasting, and KPI design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and business intuition, with the ability to connect user behavior to company outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with teams such as marketing, finance, operations, or product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating autonomously and driving ambiguous projects from idea to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to influence decisions through data and clear reasoning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to manage and deliver on multiple projects with high attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, speed, and a bias toward action in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of dashboarding and data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and grow in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in startup or high-growth consumer environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation and product analytics platforms such as Posthog, Statsig, Amplitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with dbt, Snowflake, and modern data stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lifecycle marketing, customer segmentation, or growth modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing Shakepay customer and/or familiarity with the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and enthusiasm for the possibilities enabled by Bitcoin and non-sovereign money&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the future of money: &lt;/strong&gt;Be part of a team that&#39;s revolutionizing financial services in Canada, one sat at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact millions: &lt;/strong&gt;As cryptocurrency continues to gain traction, our potential for growth is massive. You can help us bring Shakepay and Bitcoin to all Canadians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your career: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re growing, and so can you! We have programs in place to encourage continuous learning, growth, and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas, not titles: &lt;/strong&gt;We want the best ideas to make their way through, no matter where they come from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Be an owner&lt;/strong&gt; - Every employee has stock options as part of their total compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥅 &lt;strong&gt;Reach your goals&lt;/strong&gt; - Yearly salary assessments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🦷 Health &amp;amp; wellness : &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Access to comprehensive health and dental coverage, including health and wellness spending accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Remote-friendly&lt;/strong&gt;: Work from anywhere in Canada, with optional access to our office spaces in Montreal and Toronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🆙 &lt;strong&gt;Level Up&lt;/strong&gt;: A $2,000 annual budget for courses, certifications, and training to support your career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌴 Time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 20 days of vacation per year. And if you use all your vacation, we give you a $1,000 bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🐣 Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a parental leave top up to 100% of your salary for 18 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 Have fun together:&lt;/strong&gt; quarterly team-specific or company-wide offsite to connect with each other&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this position is $200,000 - $250,000 CAD. Base pay may vary based on factors such as years of experience, skills and qualifications. Additionally, employees are eligible for equity,&amp;nbsp; pay increases based on performance, benefits including health and dental care, and paid time off.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
