7826440003:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenZeppelin is the security standard onchain finance is built on. Founded in 2015, our mission is to accelerate the world&#39;s transition to an open financial system, built on open standards and secured by rigorous research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our open-source Contract Libraries have facilitated over $35 trillion in onchain value and are used by 10 of the top 10 tokenized money market funds and 9 of the top 10 stablecoins by market cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine AI-native security tooling with deep research and a decade of audit expertise to support leading institutions and crypto-native teams shaping the next generation of digital assets like DTCC, Fidelity, Coinbase, Uniswap, Aave, the Ethereum Foundation, and many more across the full secure development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400, style=;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; Always refer to OpenZeppelin&#39;s official job page for the most accurate information about our open roles, as we have seen multiple third party job sites posting inaccurate information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ecosystems Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenZeppelin&#39;s libraries and standards are the trusted foundation of onchain development across Ethereum, Stellar, Canton and beyond, powering the majority of the world&#39;s most valuable protocols and a new generation of institutional-grade financial infrastructure. The Ecosystems team builds the long-term partnerships behind that position: we work directly with L1 and L2 foundations, protocol teams and technology providers on security audits, secure development, reference implementations and strategic open-source programs that help entire ecosystems grow securely. As tokenization and institutional adoption accelerate, the team sits at the center of some of the most consequential projects in the industry. You will report to our Ecosystem Development Lead and work alongside senior sellers, our CTO office, and our solutions and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portfolio of ecosystem accounts and be responsible for growing it. This is a senior, full-cycle sales role for someone who is technical enough to lead discovery and scoping conversations with CTOs and core developers directly. You will deepen relationships with some of the most important foundations and protocol teams in the industry, and open doors to new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of ecosystem accounts (L1/L2 foundations, protocol teams, infrastructure providers) through renewals, expansion into new services, and multi-year partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business through targeted, research-driven outreach to foundations and protocol teams, typically six to seven-figure engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full sales cycle, including technical discovery: scoping security audits, secure development engagements and open-source partnership programs, and translating protocol roadmaps into compelling proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic account plans for your portfolio, staying close to your customers&#39; roadmaps and identifying opportunities early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our CTO office and solutions teams on strategic proposals, and help shape the institutional-grade solutions emerging from our largest partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent OpenZeppelin at ecosystem conferences, technical workshops and community events worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in sales or commercial roles, including 3+ years owning and exceeding revenue targets for technical products or services (Web3, security, developer tooling, or infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of closing six and seven figure deals with blockchain foundations, protocol teams, or technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real technical fluency: you understand smart contract development, EVM architecture and blockchain infrastructure well enough to lead technical conversations, read documentation and EIPs/ERCs, and earn credibility with engineering audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-cycle ownership: you prospect, qualify, propose, negotiate and close, and you run your pipeline with discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network across blockchain ecosystems, foundations and protocol teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent proposal writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background as a developer, solutions engineer or security researcher before moving into sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling security audits or security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ecosystem funding mechanics: foundation budgets, grant programs, treasury-funded partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to financial institutions, tokenization or RWA projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with onchain analytics (Dune, Nansen, block explorers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our interview process takes place on Zoom and tends to consist of the following stages:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruiter Call (30 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hiring Manager Call (60 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Team Interview (45 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leadership Interview (30&amp;nbsp;minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid work test (up to 20 paid hours of work)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reference checks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;j-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;requirements&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Meet your teammates at company gatherings around the world 😎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Enjoy the flexibility of fully remote work 🌎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Take the time you need with flexible time off 🏝&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Grow your family with 8 weeks of paid leave for primary caregivers, 4 weeks for secondary caregivers, and a one-time $3,600 baby bonus 💙&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build your ideal home office with up to $500 in equipment support 🪑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Stay covered with medical insurance 🏥&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Keep growing with learning and development opportunities 🧠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Get a monthly stipend for your preferred co-working space 💻&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
