&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Someone with 5+ years in product,&lt;/strong&gt; at least some of it consumer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Someone who builds.&lt;/strong&gt; You prototype with AI tools, wire up working demos, run your own analysis. The era of the PM who can only write documents is over, and you&#39;re glad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Someone comfortable with crypto, or unafraid of getting there fast.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to have shipped a crypto product. You need to understand why owning the rails changes what a consumer app can be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Someone who decides.&lt;/strong&gt; Small team, short cycles, no committee coming to save you.&lt;/li&gt;
