4704413006:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our mission to deliver unparalleled customer support in the dynamic world of cryptocurrency and DeFi. As a Customer Frontline Support Engineer, you will act as the first point of contact for our customers, resolving complex issues with empathy, precision, and urgency. You&#39;ll be instrumental in ensuring our customers succeed, collaborating with internal teams to deliver proactive, world-class support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is intended to work US-Eastern hours and operates on a 24/7 schedule including weekends and holidays to meet customer needs, with shifts determined based on seniority and business requirements.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hired candidate will ultimately work a fixed schedule consisting of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monday through Friday: 11:00 AM to 8:00 PM (US-Eastern)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may also be required to work weekend shifts as business needs dictate, following either a Tuesday through Saturday or Sunday through Thursday schedule (with hours to be confirmed based on the assigned rotation).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Please note that these hours are subject to change based on business needs, with or without advance notice.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training Period:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; All new hires will initially undergo training Monday through Friday during standard US-Eastern business hours. During the training period, which may last approximately 90 to 180 days depending on individual progress and proficiency with the platform, candidates may occasionally be scheduled for rotating weekend shifts (Saturday or Sunday, 11:00 AM to 8:00 PM US-Eastern) as part of their onboarding and readiness preparation. Upon successful completion of training, the employee will transition to the assigned Wednesday through Sunday schedule listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor and advocate for customers, managing inquiries with empathy and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide real-time support via Slack and other communication tools, ensuring timely and accurate resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver outstanding technical support for Fireblocks&#39; SaaS platform, going above and beyond to address customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate and collaborate on complex issues with the Senior Support Team, ensuring seamless resolution and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and resolve recurring issues, contributing to process improvements and enhancing the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cases meticulously, maintaining clear and detailed documentation throughout the support process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively during critical incidents, participating in &quot;war room&quot; calls and keeping customers informed with timely updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace and adhere to business processes and policies while suggesting improvements to enhance the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 - 2 years of experience in a customer support or similar role, with a passion for delivering exceptional service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills with the ability to work under pressure and prioritize customer needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, demonstrating professionalism and empathy in all interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build strong relationships with customers, acting as a trusted advisor and advocate for their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first mindset, ensuring that resolutions align with customer success and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in managing and resolving complex issues with a proactive and collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly to changing customer needs and prioritize tasks to meet expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to continuous learning and staying updated on the latest industry trends and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience supporting SaaS-based solutions or working in the financial services or technology sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with databases, scripting languages (Python, JavaScript, etc.), and tools like Coralogix, Kibana, Grafana, and LogStash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of blockchain technologies and cryptographic principles used in public blockchain networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work collaboratively in a team-oriented environment to solve customer challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. A reasonable base salary range estimate for this position is $90,000 to $95,000. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of you deciding to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4703919006:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Fireblocks, we’re not just developing innovative products for the world onchain finance - we’re redefining how businesses grow &amp;amp; operate in this new, quickly evolving economy. As a leader in our field, we understand that our solutions are only as successful as the success of our customers - and we love learning and sharing stories about them. That’s where you come in. We’re looking for a visionary leader to grow and elevate our product marketing team, translating product excellence into market-winning GTM strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with customers, partners, and analysts to stay close to market and competitive dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive GTM strategies for new market opportunities, emerging use cases, and points of competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management to shape roadmap strategy and positioning, translating customer and market signals into product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own launch strategy for new products and partnerships through sales readiness and customer adoption, against revenue and adoption targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve Fireblocks&#39; market positioning and messaging, across every market we strategically compete in and every buyer we sell to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product and market strategy into global GTM enablement across pre and post-sales teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage the team&#39;s strategy and OKRs, while building a culture of excellence and investing in the team&#39;s professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum Requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years experience in B2B SaaS product marketing, preference to FinServ, Payments, FinTech and Cybersecurity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of team management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great writer and storyteller, that creates meaningful content aligned to our company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced, high growth-stage startup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial-minded, with a high sense of urgency, dedication, and a drive to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to roll your sleeves up, be hands-on and lead by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator who can drive consensus and articulate recommendations to cross functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion and a willingness to learn about new technologies including digital assets and the new financial use cases they enable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be comfortable with a continuous deployment process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with segmentation strategies, developing buyer personas, articulating customer pain points, redefining market positioning and crafting client-facing messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in an ambiguous, fast-paced environment with a high degree of autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For employees hired to work remotely from New York, or from our NYC HQ, Fireblocks is required by law to include a reasonable estimate of the compensation range for this role. This range is specific to New York City, and takes into consideration a wide range of factors that are reviewed when making a hiring decision, such as years of experience, skills, and other business needs. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. A reasonable base salary range estimate for this position is $240,000-$325,000. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of you deciding to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

7828581003:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/crypto/#vertical-landing-staff&quot;&gt;team&lt;/a&gt; that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a strong Events Associate to join the a16z crypto team and help deliver thoughtful, high-touch experiences from concept through execution. This role will own key aspects of the event planning process, partnering across teams to bring exceptional experiences to life while ensuring every detail is executed seamlessly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is highly organized, detail-oriented, and thrives in a fast-paced environment. They have excellent attention to detail, sound judgement, strong research skills, and a collaborative mindset. They enjoy partnering with a wide range of stakeholders and are always looking for ways to elevate the planning process and create distinguished attendee experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The role can be based in San Francisco or New York City and requires in-office presence at least two days per week. Approximately 30% travel is expected.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Events Partner to plan and execute large-scale external events as part of the a16z crypto Marketing team. Tentpole events may include: F1, Consensus, Token2049, Korea Blockchain Week and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Manage the 12-week summer program for our Research team, including the development and execution of a 12-week curated hospitality program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee the full production of premium branded goods from conception through delivery for special projects and events including custom VIP kits, welcome kits, event gifting suites and more&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Lead private dining and salon-style hospitality moments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally with executives, GTM team, Regulatory/Policy, Research, Investment Team and more - to create seamless event and programming execution for a16z crypto’s various needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with the events colleagues across the firm to drive firm-wide visibility and alignment for all events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Own systems management and reporting for production trackers, event plans and event communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders and external vendors to produce event collateral, registration materials, signage, and other guest-facing assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee the team&#39;s event inventory, ensuring event materials are organized, accessible, and ready to support seamless execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;A strong communicator and collaborative partner who thrives in a team environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset with the adaptability to navigate shifting priorities and embrace new challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Exceptional taste, sound judgement, and impeccable attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The ability to execute on a high volume of projects and ongoing programs while staying poised under pressure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;A pulse on the latest trends in dining, hospitality, and venues, with a keen eye for creating remarkable guest experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;A creative thinker who knows how to bring a brand to life across a varied landscape both domestically and internationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Confident presence working with senior executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Be the event creator as well as the ‘boots on the ground’ executing the program flawlessly; we all do it all and there is no hierarchy in our work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate effectively with diverse teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;4–6 years of experience producing events, including large-scale conferences, summits, and executive experiences. A blend of agency and in-house experience is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing event budgets, vendor relationships, contract negotiations, and production partners, including staffing, security, AV, lighting, and other technical event components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Superior project management skills, with the ability to balance multiple priorities, deadlines, and stakeholders simultaneously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Highly organized and process-oriented, with the ability to build structure, improve workflows, and quickly learn new systems and tools (Google Workspace, Marketo, Affinity CRM, Splash, ClickUp, Salesforce, Slack, WordPress, Airtable, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;High integrity and sound judgement, with a demonstrated ability to handle confidential information with discretion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to anticipate needs, solve problems proactively, and make thoughtful decisions in fast-paced, high-visibility environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel domestically and internationally (approximately 30%) to support onsite event execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $150,000 - $165,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

7787448003:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds. We’ve invested in&lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio/&quot;&gt; companies&lt;/a&gt; like Affirm, Airbnb, Coinbase, Databricks, Figma, GitHub, Instacart, Pinterest, Roblox, Stripe, and Substack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;a16z &lt;a href=&quot;https://speedrun.a16z.com/&quot;&gt;speedrun&lt;/a&gt; is the firm’s program to invest in, and help, new startups. We run a 2x/year program that spans 12 weeks, with dozens of startups working out of a16z’s offices in SF and LA. So far we&#39;ve invested in over &lt;a href=&quot;https://speedrun.a16z.com/companies&quot;&gt;150 startups&lt;/a&gt; with $180M+ in capital deployed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a driven, founder-fluent marketer to lead all aspects of applications marketing for speedrun. This is a high-ownership, high-visibility role that sits at the intersection of content, campaigns, and community. You will own the speedrun brand voice, drive application volume and quality, and represent a16z to a global founder audience. The ideal candidate is a generalist with a talent for content marketing and multi-channel campaigns. This person will know the founder landscape deeply and can speak authentically to the communities where these founders live, work, and play. The opportunity will shape how the next generation of founders discover and engage with a16z.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role will be required to be in-person in the San Francisco office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run Founder Application Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Drive application volume and quality across campaign cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Own the full campaign cycle for founder acquisition inclusive of channel mix, asset pipeline, paid media (X, LinkedIn), and net-new growth levers including alumni referrals and word-of-mouth programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and execute strategies to reach underrepresented and emerging founder communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with the investing team to align campaign messaging with fund priorities and portfolio themes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Own and grow the speedrun newsletter (200K+ subscribers); write or edit every issue, keeping it genuinely useful and relevant to early-stage founders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Represent speedrun by producing your own content and posts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Run social across X, LinkedIn, Reddit, TikTok, and dark social channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Surface the best of the speedrun portfolio and community through founder spotlights, cohort stories, and demo day coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain speedrun&#39;s brand voice as the definitive destination for pre-seed founders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders across deal teams, operating partners, and GPs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Manage the campaign calendar and own the marketing tooling stack (HubSpot, Substack, social accounts).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Keep reporting tight across application windows, track top-of-funnel metrics, conversion rates, and community growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Leverage AI tools and automation to drive efficiency while maintaining a human-in-the-loop on all founder-facing channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Manage external agencies to support execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;7-10 years of experience in marketing, content, or growth ideally within venture, tech, or a high-growth startup.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Deep familiarity with the founder and startup ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong written communication skills: you can produce and edit newsletter content that founders actually want to read.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proven experience running multi-channel marketing campaigns with measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong operator: with a track record of building acquisition campaigns from scratch. You can manage a campaign calendar, own tooling, and keep reporting clean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and able to operate with significant autonomy in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with HubSpot, Substack, Paid social, and analytics platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Genuine passion for early-stage founders and the pre-seed ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate effectively with diverse teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly build trust with cross-functional teams and founders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $241,000 - $281,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

5383509008:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Time Temporary Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We provide nationwide technical support for photo finishing equipment installed in major retail locations. Our goal is to ensure seamless operation and minimize downtime through expert troubleshooting, proactive monitoring, and exceptional customer service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Position Summary:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented and proactive Technical Support Specialist to join our team. In this role, you will provide break/fix support both via phone and email, troubleshooting mechanical and software issues, maintaining online system connectivity, and assisting customers with equipment setup and maintenance. The ideal candidate will have experience working with photo finishing or similar technical equipment and possess excellent communication and problem-solving skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Handle outbound phone communication and email monitoring to provide break/fix support for photo finishing equipment located nationwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Live answering inbound communication to provide break/fix support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot mechanical and software issues remotely using tools such as NetOps, VNC, TeamViewer, and FIDS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Proactively monitor website offerings and connectivity status for online operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Contact retail sites showing connectivity errors or product stock issues to reduce downtime and resolve problems promptly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Guide customers through software navigation and operational procedures via remote sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Assist customers with locating part numbers, ordering parts, and installing customer replaceable units.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Support device swaps including media drives, DX printers, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;dymo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; label printers, ensuring smooth initial setup and installation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Escalate unresolved issues to appropriate departments such as Depot, OSSN, and DFS in a timely manner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Experience with remote troubleshooting tools (e.g., NetOps, VNC, TeamViewer).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of mechanical and software troubleshooting principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Customer-focused with excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks and prioritize proactive outreach to reduce equipment downtime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with photo finishing equipment or related technology is highly preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented, patient, and capable of providing clear, step-by-step guidance to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Competitive salary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work remotely and support a nationwide customer base.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Collaborative and supportive work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Training and development opportunities to grow your technical expertise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

4695148005:
&lt;p&gt;At Shakepay, we’re on a mission to usher in the Bitcoin golden age. We’re reimagining financial services to give every Canadian their fair shake.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our culture is built around doing work that matters, winning as a team, and celebrating success. If you&#39;re the kind of person who values growth, shipping fast, and sharing your ideas openly with a group of like-minded people, come and build with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Shakepay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, we&#39;ve been on a mission to help Canadians build long-term wealth through bitcoin. Over the past few years, we&#39;ve expanded beyond buying and selling bitcoin to offer a growing suite of everyday financial products - including the Shakepay Card, direct deposit, bill payments and Interac e-Transfer - making it easier to earn, save and use bitcoin every day. Today, more than 1.5 million Canadians use Shakepay to grow their bitcoin savings and take control of their financial future as we continue to push the boundaries of what modern financial services can look like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re regulated as an investment dealer across all Canadian provinces and territories, and backed by renowned venture capitalists with a funding of $44M. We have a passionate, loyal, and growing community, and we’re looking for people who want to help us build something truly special.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist, Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Data Scientist to join one of our cross-functional squads at Shakepay. You’ll work closely with engineering and design, while also partnering across marketing, finance, and operations to help us identify growth opportunities and make smarter decisions across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-moving environments, enjoys operating with high autonomy, and can turn ambiguous problems into measurable impact. You’ll combine experimentation, statistical rigor, business intuition, and product thinking to influence how we grow, retain, and better serve millions of Canadians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineers and designers across our product squads to improve acquisition, activation, retention, monetization, and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with marketing, finance, and operations teams to uncover growth opportunities and drive better business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and evangelize experimentation and decision frameworks that&amp;nbsp; help us ship and iterate quickly with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define KPIs and success metrics that&amp;nbsp; help teams stay aligned around measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use statistical analysis, forecasting, causal inference, and machine learning techniques to better understand user behavior and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-leverage opportunities proactively through deep analysis of user journeys, lifecycle behavior, conversion funnels, and financial performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape squad and company priorities by bringing data-informed perspectives on impact, tradeoffs, and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards, models, and self-serve tools that improve visibility into growth and business performance across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the broader data team to maintain a shared and consistent data layer that serves our stakeholders and internal agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of experimentation, curiosity, and evidence-based decision-making across Shakepay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data science, growth analytics, experimentation, or related roles in high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of experimentation, causal inference, statistical analysis, forecasting, and KPI design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and business intuition, with the ability to connect user behavior to company outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with teams such as marketing, finance, operations, or product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating autonomously and driving ambiguous projects from idea to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to influence decisions through data and clear reasoning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to manage and deliver on multiple projects with high attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, speed, and a bias toward action in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of dashboarding and data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and grow in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in startup or high-growth consumer environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation and product analytics platforms such as Posthog, Statsig, Amplitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with dbt, Snowflake, and modern data stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lifecycle marketing, customer segmentation, or growth modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing Shakepay customer and/or familiarity with the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and enthusiasm for the possibilities enabled by Bitcoin and non-sovereign money&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the future of money: &lt;/strong&gt;Be part of a team that&#39;s revolutionizing financial services in Canada, one sat at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact millions: &lt;/strong&gt;As cryptocurrency continues to gain traction, our potential for growth is massive. You can help us bring Shakepay and Bitcoin to all Canadians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your career: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re growing, and so can you! We have programs in place to encourage continuous learning, growth, and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas, not titles: &lt;/strong&gt;We want the best ideas to make their way through, no matter where they come from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Be an owner&lt;/strong&gt; - Every employee has stock options as part of their total compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥅 &lt;strong&gt;Reach your goals&lt;/strong&gt; - Yearly salary assessments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🦷 Health &amp;amp; wellness : &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Access to comprehensive health and dental coverage, including health and wellness spending accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Remote-friendly&lt;/strong&gt;: Work from anywhere in Canada, with optional access to our office spaces in Montreal and Toronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🆙 &lt;strong&gt;Level Up&lt;/strong&gt;: A $2,000 annual budget for courses, certifications, and training to support your career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌴 Time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 20 days of vacation per year. And if you use all your vacation, we give you a $1,000 bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🐣 Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a parental leave top up to 100% of your salary for 18 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 Have fun together:&lt;/strong&gt; quarterly team-specific or company-wide offsite to connect with each other&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this position is $150,000 - $200,000 CAD. Base pay may vary based on factors such as years of experience, skills and qualifications. Additionally, employees are eligible for equity,&amp;nbsp; pay increases based on performance, benefits including health and dental care, and paid time off.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand that potential can be just as valuable as experience. If you&#39;re eager to learn, grow, and contribute to the mission but worry that you may not have the “right” experience, we still want you to apply. We encourage applications from everyone, regardless of background and life experience. We’re firm believers that &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/gtallen1187/e83ed02eac6cc8d7e185&quot;&gt;a little bit of slope makes up for a lot of y-intercept&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We use technology, including artificial intelligence (AI), to support certain parts of our hiring process. This can include tools that assist with scheduling, application review, candidate communications, and generating interview notes, guides, or summaries so our team can stay focused on the conversation. All hiring decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluency in English is required due to the percentage of English-speaking customers and the nature of our platform, which is available to all Canadians.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

4720895005:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos is a people-first blockchain on a mission to help billions of people achieve universal and fair access to decentralized assets in a safe and scalable way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Founded by some of the original creators and maintainers that researched, designed, and built the Diem blockchain to serve this purpose, we have dedicated several years toward this mission. We believe the open-source Diem technology we have developed is an important foundation of a safe and scalable web3 world where everyone has more equitable opportunities to grow and access financial assets with lower fees and fewer intermediaries.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos (Ohlone for &quot;The People&quot;) encompasses our mission and ethos for why we build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a talented, driven Software Engineer to build the experimental trading products on Aptos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will have significant impact and visibility - . You&#39;ll help shape technical direction and may grow into leading other engineers as the team scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should love building products from scratch and experimenting building and learning from how those products are used. You will be joining a lean team with a lot of autonomy – you should be a self-starter and thrive on self-directed work in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits in our Palo Alto, CA or New York, NY office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fast to design, build, and experiment with trading products for the Aptos blockchain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing scalable APIs, indexing services, and data pipelines to support trading data access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining infrastructure for trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing clean, performant, well-tested, and production-ready code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with protocol engineers, infrastructure teams, and product engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building and shipping products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building products in languages such as Typescript or something similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leveraging AI tools to enhance productivity and code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in payments, DeFi, or TradFi (a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with blockchain (a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web3 experience or familiarity (a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this full-time position is $150k-$250k. The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and typical maximum target for new hire salaries for the position of a candidate based in the Bay Area at any level. We do hire exceptionally talented professionals with decades of experience in their field. As such, our range may be higher than what is displayed. Our base salary ranges are determined by experience and location, and we hire at all levels for multiple roles. Within the range, individual pay is determined by work location, job-related skills demonstrated during the interviews, working experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in role postings reflect the base salary only and do not include equity, tokens, or benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-PG1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;100% insurance premium coverage for medical, dental, and vision for you and your dependents (US Employees)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equipment of your choice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation time, 11 holidays, and floating company days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Protocol Token Grants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k matching (US Employees)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fun and inclusive in-person and digital events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos is committed to diversity in the workplace, and we’re proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We do not hire on the basis of race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, citizenship, age, disability, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy, parental status, sex, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, or any other basis protected by local, state or federal law. All employment is decided based on qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
