&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform delivering a secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. At Fireblocks, we enable businesses to securely build, run and scale digital asset operations through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure. Our next-generation multi-layer technology protects Digital assets from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error. Fireblocks is the only platform that provides insurance for digital assets in storage, transfer, and E&amp;amp;O.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of January 2026, we serve over 2400 institutional customers, have secured the transfer of over $10 trillion in digital assets, and are the world&#39;s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: Enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about the opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team focuses on expanding Fireblocks’ footprint across banks and large regulated financial institutions throughout the EMEA region. This is an individual contributor role responsible for driving enterprise-level sales in the UK for one of Fireblocks’ most strategic verticals. You’ll work closely with internal teams across Sales Engineering, Business Development, Product, and Marketing to deliver innovative digital asset solutions to traditional financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve and exceed monthly and quarterly revenue targets within your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business with Tier 1 and Tier 2 banks and expand existing relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end sales process — from prospecting to negotiation and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including C-suite, risk, compliance, and innovation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the BDR, GTM, and Product teams to develop and execute effective go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately update and maintain customer information in Fireblocks’ CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to ensure seamless delivery and account coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise sales experience in financial services, fintech, or institutional software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success selling to banks, custodians, or large regulated financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of banking procurement processes, including RFPs, compliance, and multi-stakeholder decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to or a strong interest in digital assets, tokenisation, and blockchain technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex sales cycles and build strategic, long-term client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and self-driven mindset with the ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to translate technical value into business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a comprehensive onboarding and training program for all new employees. We are looking for those who want to work with some of the industry&#39;s most talented contributors. You should bring a track record of success and experience closing complex deals within the financial services or fintech sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

6140725004:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have at least 3 years of experience in an accounting role, with a strong background accounting background working preferably within traditional financial services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with month-end and quarter-end close process, including daily cash, payroll, fixed assets, and prepaids&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process accounts payable, including invoice review, coding, and timely payment processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare month end reconciliations for corporate balances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with analyzing legal entity level results for service entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in intercompany eliminations and consolidation procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with counterparts in other departments to investigate, reconcile and record correct entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with various stakeholders on projects including, acquisitions and internal restructures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with FP&amp;amp;A team and SEC reporting team on their requests and various initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and respond to audit requests for various entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years’ experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with maintaining books and records of a bank or a financial institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and working with datasets in Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to innovate and implement new procedures to improve processes and workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious self-starter, comfortable in ambiguity and a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong appetite for problem solving in a high growth business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a can-do attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;College degree with a competitive GPA and demonstrated math or analytical ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitasks, contributing to several projects at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at public accounting firm is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Netsuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Competitive paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Working Arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid health and protective benefits for employees and their eligible dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coaching and counseling sessions through Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn about the Crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart, entrepreneurial, and fun colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Galaxy respects diversity and seeks to provide equal employment opportunities to all employees and job applicants for employment without regard to actual or perceived age, race, color, creed, religion, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, lactation and related medical conditions), gender identity or gender expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital or partnership or caregiver status, ancestry, national origin, citizenship status, disability, military or veteran status, protected medical condition as defined by applicable state or local law, genetic information or predisposing genetic characteristic, or other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local laws and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will endeavor to make a reasonable accommodation to the known limitations of a qualified applicant with a disability unless the accommodation would impose an undue hardship on the operation of our business. If you believe you require such assistance to complete the application process or to participate in an interview, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@galaxy.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@galaxy.com.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4954982101:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;UgO9d5qd4oRJq1xx5F2uDNwHsVf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QbSPdleyCouucRxFXVDuElbMsOC&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VsM6dr9KVoKQ4wxitNHuYpg1sef&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Product Manager to join the Growth Intelligence team and lead the development and delivery of high-impact growth projects across SEO, ASO, Learn, Copy, and Translation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H92gdJSnEovAeDxtkX5u6VCLsCd&quot;&gt;This role will act as the central Product Manager across these functions, transforming business requirements into clear product solutions, aligning stakeholders, working directly with engineers, and ensuring projects are delivered with measurable business impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TLq4dWLWRohSGoxeE3buxMT3sMd&quot;&gt;Fluency in both Mandarin and English is a mandatory requirement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-E8IWdybevoF3IlxTu31uzFV3sKh&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JQVXdhhKTotH9wxBBftuPlG3sqe&quot;&gt;Product Strategy and Business Analysis&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ui3AdmBFwo15P7xxEZ4uOpFjsUd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct detailed business analysis across SEO, ASO, Learn, Copy, and Translation initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZljdKMbloqP47xt980uHfrasbd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assess business problems, user needs, operational gaps, and growth opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EV7md1KJAoADfYxhdZ4uQhQlsdb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Review and challenge MRDs and business requests to ensure they are supported by clear data, business value, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LllYd6NIqomL9yxV2isuVJySswk&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate approved business requirements into structured product strategies and execution plans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZDs7d8csgo58cixpc50u8nAysEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prioritize projects based on expected impact, urgency, resource requirements, and strategic alignment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LqWddg8jworqllxsGCWuLxvws8d&quot;&gt;MRD and PRD Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q0rcdUVRfonie8xDrgau787EsIc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the creation, assessment, and refinement of Market Requirements Documents and Product Requirements Documents.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UJn8d8CdLozht2xUkFduPokpsBh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Convert business requirements into clear product features, workflows, user stories, acceptance criteria, and technical requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BYcfdHRSNocA07xiMRIugC2dsIf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify missing requirements, dependencies, risks, and potential implementation challenges before development begins.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tf3gdnJYYoer8ax60qNua6rpsag&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure every project has a clearly defined problem statement, target users, success metrics, scope, and expected business outcome.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZK7hdQv6goCiBExRVc2uUNlTsNe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain product documentation throughout the full project lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BE1gdv6LCommKIxg7JduSeW9sQG&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Project Delivery&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUTCduVCYonqrkxAFL1uUlR7sGf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as the central Product Manager for projects involving SEO, ASO, Learn, Copy, and Translation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqD6dYMYoo5RaSxcitLuBFbKsLd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work directly with engineering, data, design, operations, marketing, and business teams to move projects from concept to launch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGAqdYznuogdTQxzWQFu8ejzsUd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage project priorities, timelines, dependencies, blockers, and stakeholder expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Seufd9h4FoYCycxRo1ouldpvsQf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Help accelerate project delivery by ensuring engineers receive complete, validated, and actionable requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UGb2d7uRcogX7TxyFNSumxJQsA4&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate across multiple teams and ensure clear ownership throughout execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CsIJdPiTbomH8hxAnDAuDluMsvc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support product testing, launch readiness, rollout planning, and post-launch optimization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GtoodrML4oQykqx0JXwu1FuXsvc&quot;&gt;Measurement and Resource Allocation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdrsdgRWJoLsolxMQhLu4tY2swD&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define clear success metrics and measurement frameworks for every project.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PzHodHtHqo7m4GxFmKMuikg0sEd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Measure project performance against adoption, efficiency, conversion, revenue, cost reduction, productivity, and other relevant growth indicators.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcgydOJPlohXVlxzRhzuLQEjsde&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct post-launch analysis to determine whether projects delivered the expected business impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q11odzHszoH0f2x7RHFuVmEzsAg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify underperforming projects and recommend corrective actions, scope changes, or resource reallocation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HdAEdZkDiosBgUxBpHtuWisisfg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide data-backed recommendations on where engineering and operational resources should be invested.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJnYdTHkboVrSCxxewUunMAAsoc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build clear reporting for leadership covering project performance, impact, risks, and next priorities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TGF3dLSkrokc2xxLYt8uMEnrsYP&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D7OVd9aMNoIWaOxrstZuEoU4sXg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Professional fluency in both Mandarin and English is mandatory.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SQfEdAPrzoxgjTxXqQguQB1Asgb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager within a Growth Product, Growth Technology, Growth Platform, or Growth Intelligence team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OAAndigoyoFq8wxblG8ukJK8s4b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong experience developing, reviewing, and managing MRDs and PRDs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOR4dwyIToz9q1xqhGlusYuesQd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate business problems into scalable product and technical solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QqDPdZRBxoi34MxIGKNuoJMvsYg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working directly with engineering teams throughout the product development lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gc9hdSiJGo8mxMxvOlousZYQsNe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong business analysis, data interpretation, prioritization, and project management capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjKldyMr5oMqdGxcRxxuJZClsnd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience defining product success metrics and measuring post-launch performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSzSdeHL4oQuJXxNNecuogD4slh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to manage multiple cross-functional projects simultaneously.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X8bcdnlOpoF523xWgvDu1zmEseb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills across business and technical teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NjNudhpPXojLOCxyHxyuw9CYsXc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-moving, highly cross-functional environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZLdxdvVuuoEVMdxhcl0uco15saf&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrsOdEJdSoXMEVxIOxiuEOHlsPb&quot;&gt;Experience in three or more of the following areas is strongly preferred:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QNQndbPe0ouiAIxQVjUuHC55sdd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;SEO platforms, content discovery, technical SEO, or search performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gr2fdpcgGo3i4uxzzGAuoSTUsFh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;ASO, mobile acquisition, app-store conversion, or app growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzhXdd2EboaIaCxsTf3uz55FsNc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Learning platforms, educational content, or content-led user acquisition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-En6vdoXf0oPmpPxyRbnuheHpsHc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Copywriting operations, content management systems, or AI-assisted content production.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTYqdXFtZo5Pg1x2pJyuzjcUsBg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
