&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is a pioneering team of operators, investors, and builders committed to revolutionizing institutional access to the crypto markets. Operating at the intersection of traditional finance and  cutting-edge technology, FalconX addresses the industry&#39;s foremost challenges: Navigating the digital asset market can be complex and fragmented, with limited products and services that support trading strategies, structures, and liquidity found in conventional financial markets. As a comprehensive solution for all digital asset strategies from start to scale, FalconX operates as the connective tissue empowering clients with seamless navigation through the ever- evolving cryptocurrency landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low-Latency Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, provision, and maintain ultra-low latency AWS and hybrid network topologies, including VPCs, exchange gateways, and regional deployment expansions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tuning:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize Linux OS kernels and compute performance using CPU isolation (isolcpus), AWS Cluster Placement Groups, and enhanced networking (ENA/ENI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive infrastructure automation, provisioning, and configuration management using Terraform and Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect infrastructure to support expanding Exchange Market Making (EMM), Project Market Making (PMM), and TradFi exchange convergences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Build telemetry and monitoring pipelines using Grafana Cloud and Alloy to ensure continuous visibility into platform performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide the technical roadmap, mentor junior engineers, and act as an escalation lead for critical system incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Infrastructure Engineering, Systems Engineering, or SRE, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;low-latency electronic trading environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Linux Internals Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced experience with kernel-level performance tuning, memory management, and network I/O optimization (isolcpus, network profiling, ring buffers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS Low-Latency Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leveraging AWS low-latency constructs (Placement Groups, ENA/ENI, high-performance EC2 instance optimization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading Protocols &amp;amp; Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with FIX protocol, Aeron messaging, or low-latency colocation connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HFT &amp;amp; Market Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with high-frequency trading (HFT) workflows or crypto exchange API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; for cloud infrastructure and &lt;strong&gt;Ansible&lt;/strong&gt; for OS configuration and patching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of physical network topologies, TCP/IP, UDP, and low-latency network routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containers &amp;amp; CI/CD:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Docker, Docker Compose, Jenkins, and modern deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience setting up production monitoring using Grafana Cloud, Alloy, or Prometheus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on scripting capability in Python/Bash, with development experience in &lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt; preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hardware acceleration technologies (FPGAs, SmartNICs) or custom network card driver tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of PTP (Precision Time Protocol) / IEEE 1588 or clock synchronization setup for high-precision trade timestamping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base pay for this role is expected to be between $179,000 - $218,000 in New York City.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;This expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. This role will also be eligible for other forms of compensation such as a performance linked bonus, equity, and a competitive benefits package. Actual compensation for a successful candidate will be determined based on a number of factors such as location, skillset, experience, qualifications &lt;strong&gt;and the level at which the candidate is hired.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants located in California and/or applying to a role based in California, please refer to our Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.google.com/document/d/14H2RKQ1L1ezo605QXotmqxCOnKgIuv21oB-95zR7_0I/edit?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1715533493387657&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q6amAagRdjSqTfoecQ4aY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is committed to building a diverse, inclusive, equitable, and safe workspace for all people. Our roles are intended for people from all walks of life. We encourage all those interested in applying to our organization to submit an application regardless if you are missing some of the listed background requirements, skills, or experiences!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our commitment to inclusivity, FalconX would like to acknowledge that the EEOC survey has limited potential responses that you can select. For legal reasons, FalconX must use this language to align with federal requirements, however, we want to ensure that you are able to provide a response to our own voluntary survey questions about your identity that best aligns with your most true self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;FalconX is an equal opportunity employer and will not discriminate against an applicant or employee based on race, color, religion, national origin, ancestry, ethnicity, sex (including gender, pregnancy, sexual orientation, and gender identity), age, physical or mental disability, veteran or military status, genetic information, citizenship, or any other legally-recognized protected basis under federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Applicants with disabilities may be entitled to reasonable accommodation under the Americans with Disabilities Act and other applicable state or local laws. A reasonable accommodation is a change in the way things are normally done which will ensure an equal employment opportunity without imposing undue hardship on FalconX. Please inform FalconX’s People team at recruiting@falconx.io, if you need assistance with participating in the application process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4721111005:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is a pioneering team of operators, investors, and builders committed to revolutionizing institutional access to the crypto markets. Operating at the intersection of traditional finance and  cutting-edge technology, FalconX addresses the industry&#39;s foremost challenges: Navigating the digital asset market can be complex and fragmented, with limited products and services that support trading strategies, structures, and liquidity found in conventional financial markets. As a comprehensive solution for all digital asset strategies from start to scale, FalconX operates as the connective tissue empowering clients with seamless navigation through the ever- evolving cryptocurrency landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Compliance Associate, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markets Surveillance&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Compliance team and play a central role in maintaining the integrity of our trading platform and digital asset markets. In this role, you will independently investigate trade surveillance alerts, assist with token and asset due diligence, and contribute to the ongoing development of our surveillance program as our business scales. You will work at the intersection of compliance, data, AI, and market structure — leveraging vendor-based and FalconX&#39;s internal surveillance tooling to detect manipulation, monitor market conduct, and ensure our platform meets the highest regulatory standards across the jurisdictions in which we operate. This role requires equal parts investigative rigor, technical comfort, and clear communication, and offers a unique opportunity to shape surveillance practice at one of the leading institutional digital asset platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trade Surveillance &amp;amp; Market Abuse Detection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alert Triage &amp;amp; Investigation&lt;/strong&gt;: Independently review, investigate, and disposition trade surveillance alerts across digital asset markets, including potential wash trading, spoofing, layering, front-running, and insider trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pattern Recognition: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze trading activity across order books, execution venues, and counterparties to identify manipulative patterns, anomalous behaviors, and coordinated trading schemes in both spot, spot-related derivatives markets, and tokenized real world assets and their derivative markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Escalation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify regulatory red flags and suspicious trading patterns, and prepare comprehensive investigative narratives with supporting evidence to escalate to the Compliance Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Token &amp;amp; Asset Due Diligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Listing Assessments&lt;/strong&gt;: Conduct thorough due diligence on tokens and digital assets prior to onboarding, evaluating tokenomics, liquidity profiles, smart contract risk, governance structures, and issuer background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ongoing Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously assess listed assets for material changes—regulatory actions, delistings on peer venues, rug-pull indicators, wash trading in underlying markets, or significant shifts in holder concentration—and escalate findings with clear risk narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Integrity Scoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to internal frameworks for assessing asset-level manipulation risk, incorporating on-chain analytics, order book health metrics, and cross-venue liquidity indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Augmented Investigation: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage AI-assisted surveillance tooling to investigate alerts and surface risk patterns, contribute to real-world feedback on model outputs, prompt effectiveness, and detection gaps to continuously improve the accuracy and utility of FalconX&#39;s surveillance capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Engineering and Data teams to enhance surveillance platform capabilities, contributing use-case requirements, testing detection scenarios, and validating model outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Compliance &amp;amp; Audit Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a deep, up-to-date understanding of market abuse regulations across jurisdictions (CFTC, SEC, MiCA, MAS) and digital-asset-specific guidance to ensure surveillance coverage remains fully compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Compliance Manager to update surveillance procedures, detection playbooks, and standard operating procedures (SOPs) as regulations and market structures evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in gathering investigation documentation, alert disposition records, and tuning rationale for internal audits, bank partner reviews, and regulatory examinations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigation Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain thorough, audit-ready investigation records with complete evidence chains, ensuring absolute data confidentiality in line with global privacy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Help compile regular reports on alert volumes, disposition rates, true-positive ratios, and investigation turnaround times to assist leadership in capacity planning and program effectiveness assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Economics, Data Science, Criminology, Law, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3–5 years of direct experience in trade surveillance, market abuse investigations within digital assets, fintech, proprietary trading, or brokerage firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with surveillance platforms, transaction monitoring systems, and data analysis tools to investigate complex trading behaviors. Demonstrated comfort working with AI-assisted workflows, including LLM-powered investigation tools, prompt-driven analysis, or AI-augmented alert triage — and the critical judgment to identify where AI outputs require human validation or correction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional attention to detail with the ability to reconstruct trading sequences, identify coordinated activity across accounts, and distinguish legitimate strategies from manipulative conduct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Crisp verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to document complex investigations clearly and explain market conduct expectations to non-compliance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base pay for this role is expected to be between $111,000 - $140,000&amp;nbsp;in the New York City Area. &lt;/strong&gt;This expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. This role will also be eligible for other forms of compensation such as a performance linked bonus, equity, and a competitive benefits package. Actual compensation for a successful candidate will be determined based on a number of factors such as location, skillset, experience, qualifications &lt;strong&gt;and the level at which the candidate is hired.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants located in California and/or applying to a role based in California, please refer to our Notice at Collection and Privacy Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.google.com/document/d/14H2RKQ1L1ezo605QXotmqxCOnKgIuv21oB-95zR7_0I/edit?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1715533493387657&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q6amAagRdjSqTfoecQ4aY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FalconX is committed to building a diverse, inclusive, equitable, and safe workspace for all people. Our roles are intended for people from all walks of life. We encourage all those interested in applying to our organization to submit an application regardless if you are missing some of the listed background requirements, skills, or experiences!&lt;/p&gt;
