&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Sales Engineer for &lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the go-to product and technical expert for Alpaca&#39;s enterprise partners across&amp;nbsp; and the wider APAC region. You will bridge technical and business conversations: a customer-facing engineer with strong API knowledge, experience supporting enterprise customers, fluency in Mandarin for customer interactions, and sufficient English proficiency to collaborate effectively with our global team. You will support enterprise partners and expand our base of enterprise partners in APAC, acting as the technical bridge between local partners, vendors, and regulators and Alpaca&#39;s global engineering team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide technical support and relationship management for existing enterprise customers in APAC , acting as a trusted technical advisor throughout the partner lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Sales and Solutions teams on pre-sales technical discussions, solution design, and API consultations, and present compelling product and technical use cases to prospective clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guide new enterprise customers through API integration, implementation, and onboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as the voice of Mandarin customers by collaborating with Product and Engineering teams to improve localized experiences; translate complex business and technical requirements (often originating in Mandarin) into clear specifications for Alpaca&#39;s global engineering team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the product and technical subject matter expert, capable of thoroughly understanding and articulating all aspects of the Alpaca platform to diverse audiences and stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with local compliance and operations teams to understand local and regional product requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own technical sales engagement end-to-end: discovery calls, solution validation, RFPs, and security questionnaires that win deals; lead demo strategy and execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Create sales support materials and documentation for new features and products, including Mandarin-language collateral where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate in Mandarin with local regulators, vendors, and partners, and relay those requirements to global product and engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help customers successfully adopt Alpaca&#39;s platform while maintaining a high standard of technical and customer support; travel within APAC as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stay updated on internal product development timelines and work closely with the product team to test and roll out new features to partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for (Must-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting enterprise / B2B customers in a technical, sales engineering, or solutions engineering role (typically 5+ years), ideally at API or SaaS-first companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of REST APIs, SDKs, and software integration workflows; hands-on experience with APIs, WebSockets, Postman, Grafana, and JSON.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native or business-level Mandarin&lt;/strong&gt;, with excellent customer communication skills and a solid understanding of Mandarin business culture - essential for partner, vendor, and regulator communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-level English&lt;/strong&gt; for collaborating with global, cross-functional teams; able to drive clarity on goals, set expectations, and collect feedback effectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Able to translate complex technical concepts into simple, understandable terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Self-starter who thrives in a startup environment, manages multiple assignments simultaneously, works independently, and drives projects to completion with close attention to detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Might Be (Nice-To-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in fintech, capital markets, brokerage, or financial APIs; experience at a Broker-Dealer or securities firm in APAC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of brokerage, post-trade, and settlement operations, as well as regulatory context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Closing enterprise deals alongside Account Executives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;US securities qualifications (e.g., SIE and/or Series 7).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Metabase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with the FIX protocol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with OpenAPI, ReadMe, and documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excited to learn more about the securities industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8695826002:
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage provides an AI platform that helps thousands of businesses worldwide detect and prevent money laundering, payment fraud, and other financial crimes - stopping criminal funds from moving through the financial system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Financial Strategy team sits at the centre of how the business plans, invests, and grows, working directly with the CFO and Board. We&#39;re looking for a technically strong senior individual contributor to join us on a three month fixed term contract, providing additional capacity across our budgeting and reporting cycles at a demanding point in the year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who can pick up complex workstreams quickly, work autonomously, and deliver to a high standard from week one. You will report jointly to the Senior Director, Financial Strategy and the Manager, Financial Strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll provide senior IC support across all workstreams of the budgeting and reporting cycles, taking direction on priorities and then running with them independently. Day to day, your role includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the monthly reporting cycle, including variance analysis, commentary and preparing outputs for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the annual budgeting process, including producing spreadsheets, consolidating inputs and stress-testing assumptions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extracting, combining, and reconciling data across finance and commercial systems, and tightening the processes and templates that sit around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing Board presentations and KPI packs to a high standard of accuracy and presentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside the wider Finance team to unblock and absorb work wherever the pressure sits during the cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a self-directed senior FP&amp;amp;A individual contributor who can land quickly in a fast-moving environment and needs limited hand-holding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically strong. &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced spreadsheet capabilities and financial analysis skills, able to build robust and easy-to-follow spreadsheets that others depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience. &lt;/strong&gt;Four or more years in FP&amp;amp;A, with a track record of owning budgeting and reporting workstreams end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process fluency. &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with the mechanics of a budgeting and monthly reporting cycle, and able to spot and fix weak points in a process while running it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy. &lt;/strong&gt;You take a brief, ask the right clarifying questions once, and then deliver without needing to be managed through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability. &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable taking direction from two stakeholders, reprioritising quickly, and switching between workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial statements. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong working knowledge of the three financial statements and accounting methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data fluency. &lt;/strong&gt;Confident extracting and combining data across multiple systems, and improving how that data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication. &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to explain complex topics simply and hold their own with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability. &lt;/strong&gt;Able to start at short notice and commit to the full three month term.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education. &lt;/strong&gt;A bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS or technology background. &lt;/strong&gt;Desirable, but not essential, or a track record of thriving in fast-paced, dynamic environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems. &lt;/strong&gt;Exposure to Google Sheets-based planning environments, Abacum, Salesforce, Looker or BigQuery, and Light/Xero ERP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI adoption. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve started applying AI to finance or analytical work, and you&#39;re keen to use it here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to empower every business to eliminate financial crime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By harnessing AI, a unified platform, and an extensive partner ecosystem, we help customers turn compliance into a catalyst for growth, operational resilience, and enduring regulatory trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 3,000 enterprises across 75 countries rely on our end-to-end platform and the world’s most comprehensive financial crime risk intelligence. With full-stack agentic automation, we help organizations automate up to 95% of KYC, AML, and sanctions reviews, cut onboarding times by 50%, reduce false positives by 70%, and handle 7x more work with the same staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage is headquartered in London and has global hubs in New York, Lisbon, Singapore, and Cluj-Napoca. It is backed by Balderton Capital, Index Ventures, Ontario Teachers’ Pension Plan, Goldman Sachs, and Andreessen Horowitz. Learn more about compliance re-engineered for the age of AI at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://complyadvantage.com&quot;&gt;complyadvantage.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8695862002:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for driven, talented Software Engineers to join our Transaction Services team within the Platform Tribe. You will help build and maintain backend platform components that power our SaaS-based transaction monitoring solutions and enable new client product offerings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Software Engineer, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write new features that enable orchestration of complex workflows in our platform as well as large scale data migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of our scrum teams and help us make the right technical and architectural decisions as we evolve and scale our systems. As a team member, we will look to you to sometimes take a lead in these discussions and bring your own ideas as well as solicit and incorporate ideas from others in the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write tests, and take ownership of the systems that ensure the quality of our code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be working alongside our ML engineers, data scientists, and other software engineers within the tribe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our technology stack is designed to run on public cloud architectures, notably AWS and GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development is organised around Kotlin and Python for our backend languages and TypeScript/ES6+React for our frontend stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make substantial use of relational database technologies, notably Postgres and also use of large scale noSQL technologies such as Cassandra&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We also use an event-sourced model powered by Kafka for our communication bus and gRPC for our intra-service communication protocol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For our data and AI teams, experience of machine learning development and very large scale columnar data stores (e.g. Apache HBase, Databricks) is key, as well as experience of large scale data streaming technologies such as Apache Spark, graph databases (e.g. Neo4j, AWS Neptune, TigerGraph)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use modern observability solutions built on Grafana Cloud, and deploy our code using ArgoCD&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer, you will have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years experience writing production-grade Kotlin or Java based applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of a range of languages and paradigms, with the ability to share knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high scale applications such as APIs dealing with large request volumes, or data processing pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerisation and cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of software from idea inception to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with tooling for testing, build and deployment pipelines (setting it up is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working understanding of logging, monitoring and alerting tooling (setting it up is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and written skills including experience producing technical documentation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It would be nice if you had experience working in a multi-disciplinary team (ML Engineers, SREs, Product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked in an agile environment and have experience in pair programming&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc/BA degree in computer science, engineering or related discipline OR relevant years of experience in required skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equity as we want you to have a part of what we are building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Unlimited Time Off Policy- A work-life balance and focus on our well-being are critical to keeping us performing at our best&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We embrace a hybrid approach that requires employees to be in the office for two days a week. We strongly believe that this approach fosters collaboration and enables the building of meaningful relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will also get a new starter budget to kit out your home office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on innovative projects with smart-minded people keen to share their knowledge and continuously improve &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Annual learning budget (prorated based on start date) to drive your performance and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;The base salary range for this role is 48,000 - 60,000 EUR + equity and benefits. The actual pay may vary based on factors such as location, experience, and skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to empower every business to eliminate financial crime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By harnessing AI, a unified platform, and an extensive partner ecosystem, we help customers turn compliance into a catalyst for growth, operational resilience, and enduring regulatory trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 3,000 enterprises across 75 countries rely on our end-to-end platform and the world’s most comprehensive financial crime risk intelligence. With full-stack agentic automation, we help organizations automate up to 95% of KYC, AML, and sanctions reviews, cut onboarding times by 50%, reduce false positives by 70%, and handle 7x more work with the same staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage is headquartered in London and has global hubs in New York, Lisbon, Singapore, and Cluj-Napoca. It is backed by Balderton Capital, Index Ventures, Ontario Teachers’ Pension Plan, Goldman Sachs, and Andreessen Horowitz. Learn more about compliance re-engineered for the age of AI at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://complyadvantage.com&quot;&gt;complyadvantage.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

8687964002:
&lt;h3&gt;About the position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Recruiting Operations Specialist to help us optimize our global recruiting processes, support our systems, and manage key projects. You will be based in our New York office, while also providing crucial support for our European and Asian offices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your project management skills and technical aptitude will help us maintain our high standards for hiring exceptional talent. Additional responsibilities of the role will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastering our recruiting tech stack, troubleshooting issues, and providing time zone-specific coverage for global offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting workflows, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing solutions to reduce operational friction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving recruiting initiatives from planning to execution, and maintaining clear communication with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with internal teams on recruiting tools and translating user needs into requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining data integrity, creating reports on key metrics, and offering data-driven recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 4-8 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with recruiting tools and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with strong project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systematic thinker with experience documenting complex processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-sufficient problem solver who is comfortable with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable analyzing data and drawing conclusions from it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience developing tools in partnership with engineering and product teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced working on multi-disciplinary recruiting teams or in multi-office, high-growth environments is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

8700980002:
&lt;h3&gt;About the position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to give you a real sense of what it&#39;s like to work at Jane Street full time while providing a truly unparalleled educational experience. &amp;nbsp;We are looking for individuals of all majors who are interested in exploring what a career as a Trading Desk Operations Engineer (TDOE) might be like. Our TDOE internship is an immersive and fast-paced program that allows you to work on real-world projects directly tied to the challenges we face daily on the trading desk, all guided by a dedicated TDOE mentor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have the opportunity to wear many hats and tackle diverse projects such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and optimizing infrastructure and operational processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting trading systems and workflows by executing data queries and coordinating with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing solutions for a range of trading and operations-related issues on the desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through these experiences, you&#39;ll gain a comprehensive understanding of the trading product, including its life cycle, regulatory considerations, and operational workflows. Plus, you&#39;ll have a chance to build off your new professional growth with bootcamps and classes that are tailored to accelerate your technical and operational expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our collaborative trading desks are central to our office environment, and we believe the best way to integrate our interns is through a hands-on, interactive approach. Some of the tools developed by our interns have had a real impact on our trading desks. We can&#39;t wait to teach you what we know, and learn a few things from you as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about Jane Street&#39;s internship programme &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.janestreet.com/join-jane-street/internships/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;ve never thought about a career in finance, you&#39;re in good company. Many of us were in the same position before working here. If you have a curious mind, a collaborative spirit, and a passion for solving interesting problems, we have a feeling you&#39;ll fit right in. We&#39;re more interested in how you think and learn than what you currently know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning to graduate in 2027 or 2028, all backgrounds are welcome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical thinker with a strong quantitative foundation and an interest in growing your programming skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with a &quot;no job too small&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in finance and passionate about STEM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to balance competing priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, organised, reliable, and courteous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent verbal and written communicator; able to use technical knowledge and strong collaboration skills to reach solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually humble; eager to ask questions and learn new things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Jane Street will provide flights to and from London as well as accommodation throughout the entirety of the programme.&lt;/p&gt;

4939865101:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As part of the Social Media team, your mission is to create high-quality, social-first video content that brings Bitpanda’s brand, products, campaigns, and events to life across our channels. You combine strong camera skills, editing craft, and a good understanding of social media formats to produce content that feels premium, engaging, and platform-native.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have strong hands-on experience with camera operation and understand both the technical and creative side of shooting content – from studio setups to event coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are confident working with Adobe Premiere Pro and have a strong understanding of editing for social-first formats and short-form storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You ideally have basic to intermediate skills in Adobe After Effects and are comfortable creating simple animations and motion graphics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are interested in social media, digital culture, finance, and emerging technologies, &amp;amp; understand what makes content work across platforms like Instagram, TikTok, YT etc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You already have experience working with AI-powered creative tools and are able to generate AI-supported video assets and visuals as part of modern content production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shoot and edit high-quality social-first video content for Bitpanda’s social media channels, campaigns, studio productions, and events. You&#39;ll also support the creation of internal video content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operate camera setups independently in both studio and live environments, ensuring strong visual quality and storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit engaging short-form content optimized for social platforms, with a strong focus on pacing, hooks, and audience retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support the creation of motion graphics, animations, and AI-supported creative assets where relevant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with the Creative team, especially Concept and Design, to develop visually strong, premium content formats that align with the Bitpanda brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Flexibility to work where you thrive&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy the freedom of our Hybrid working model, combining onsite collaboration and remote work, with an additional 25 days per year to work from a city or country of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Reward for your impact&lt;/strong&gt; – Receive a competitive total compensation package aligned with Bitpanda’s pay-for-impact policy, including participation in our stock option plan.&lt;/li&gt;
