&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJyCPHhs0miGUCI4BsCiWDf&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuskmLQ8ddTfJQHCsl435vp1e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience in a Head of IA or equivalent role at a crypto/fintech entity regulated in the EU.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus2c5LR05LyGp40UmI4szO2f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with IIA&#39;s Three Lines Model implementation and maturity advancement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
