&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUNhudm97a0dUYDDIKbuIde&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficiency in data analytics using SQL, Python, and AI tools for audit evidence gathering, continuous monitoring, and fraud detection.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
