&lt;div&gt;Lead and execute risk-based IT audits across EU operations, covering key technology, cybersecurity, ICT risk, operational resilience, data protection, and third-party risk areas.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscBaYmpfMzWnMcDUD66Obrf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
