&lt;div&gt;Own the &lt;strong&gt;product growth marketing strategy for NEA&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong focus on measurable business outcomes, including user acquisition, activation, trading activity, retention and revenue.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GIp6dlCQ6ofv9axUEd0lennYgkb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
