&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TUKDd8eQIolJSAx9mdnlUnM8g2b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop market-specific GTM strategies with appropriate consideration for &lt;strong&gt;local regulatory requirements, user targeting, communication boundaries and distribution approaches&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with relevant internal stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VSfMd9ckcovIWexPPbAlVxsTgpf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build scalable growth playbooks that can be tested in individual NEA markets and expanded when proven successful.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
