4952921101:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RUoPdKG3CoaD0RxIxZguCyGZsAe&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XBlLddy3VoNT3txbaGNun1hrsPf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JEr5dyMSUoM2wtxuZGXuPcN0sSf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusHGfakvLWaL8WPWprXPeF6g&quot;&gt;Job Brief&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustWQGDcYdsXZKzz6jW3iqzf&quot;&gt;We are expanding our focus to cover AI-augmented threat intelligence and post-quantum cryptographic (PQC) security. The ideal candidate will combine deep blockchain forensics expertise with working knowledge of machine learning techniques for anomaly detection, and awareness of quantum computing threats to current cryptographic foundations (ECDSA, RSA) used across blockchain ecosystems. We value candidates who can bridge academia and industry and build collaborative relationships with research institutions to accelerate the adoption of emerging cryptographic and AI-driven techniques within the company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GgRydFSptomveSxMGexu0LdAsAd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxus6p2Feyu3IDbsRmQ37giNic&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities of a Blockchain Risk Control Analyst/Researcher&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus9nxhMp5469L98BCuHVf09b&quot;&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxushSEZSiy20NhXbosiIzl2he&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Leveraging LLM techniques to drive the development of next-generation on-chain risk identification and threat intelligence systems, including autonomous agent workflows capable of continuous monitoring, self-triggered investigation, and automated operational responses — reducing manual intervention across the full risk lifecycle from detection to resolution;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusj58brgTkRTa08Q6h9ApwKh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Leading forensic investigations on real crypto theft, fraud, and market manipulation cases, integrating AI-assisted pattern recognition to accelerate root cause analysis;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusPaLjsYOqBVcfnrLgSnu5Jb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Researching post-quantum cryptographic algorithms (NIST PQC: ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA, FALCON) and their implications for blockchain security; assessing quantum computing threats to existing cryptographic foundations (ECDSA secp256k1, hash functions) and evaluating migration paths;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7dSIpm4e7cH1HoV09o6Cqh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partnering with internal teams and external stakeholders for incident response, and engaging with academic institutions to translate frontier research into deployable security tools;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SqM4d4wIuoeirzxHey4uoZxGsN0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxus6uThYblSFlJTXZtdILCvXg&quot;&gt;Key Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3DoTlgQkg41P1oEinoEDWd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You have a Master&#39;s or PhD&#39;s degree in Blockchain security, Computer Science, Data Science, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusn5hLHT3hAP3ixYUCRWol8g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are good at programming languages commonly used in blockchain analytics (e.g., SQL, Python, Javascript)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusiKgRvnwLj6FEqgpdV85fIc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience applying machine learning or AI techniques to blockchain data analysis, fraud detection, or threat intelligence&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus8cJMCTCWLcSdERosDe8jPg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A strong publication record in top-level industry or academic conferences is highly valued.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuskDSmyWRUZ0wV14aN5gVv3c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You have experience with blockchain monitoring/forensic tools and analytics platforms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus72LB2B4fEgnhhFs1D8FxZb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with NIST PQC standards (ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA, FALCON) and lattice/hash-based cryptography fundamentals is a plus;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusoxtnXehgu8HQUX4NT9sAFf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of quantum computing threats to elliptic curve cryptography and implications for key management in Web3;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusHQbIAMZZdN6NKSB7hfWx6f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You have security or risk control experience as a plus.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussxPbYU5Du2OH3pSYD1cv6d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You possess effective communication and collaboration abilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusKYrFNrTTBuCbwMuJ0vvpng&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;English is essential, and proficiency in Mandarin can be an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4716257005:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;DV is looking for a Credit Risk Manager to lead its counterparty and credit risk management function by evaluating clients, counterparties, and credit investments while identifying, measuring, and mitigating risk across the firm&#39;s global trading activities. This role will partner closely with senior leadership to enhance the firm&#39;s credit risk framework, deliver actionable risk insights, and support strategic decision-making as DV continues to expand its products and markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Counterparty and Credit Risk Management practice at DV Trading by engaging business partners to perform diligence and credit risk analysis of clients, counterparties, and credit investments (such as corporate bonds or loans)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop a Credit Risk framework and advise senior leadership on our evolving trading business and strategic oversight to develop leading risk metrics and appropriately measure and manage emerging risks and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend internal credit risk ratings based on a firmwide model and prepare written assessments to substantiate the periodic credit review for rating upgrades/downgrades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform portfolio reviews and evaluate potential exposures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-Lead the Credit Risk Committee with the CFO and CRO by preparing materials that clearly communicate Counterparty and Credit Risk Analytics to senior management by building your own data, metrics, trends, and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of experience in counterparty or credit risk management with a preference for experience in the proprietary trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for prior experience in credit risk for analyzing commodities producers/consumers, digital assets, and financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to resolve complex client challenges or learn new products by collaborating with business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite, SQL, Python, data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaboration skills, including navigating leadership and interpersonal working relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;748&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ac93e0b889c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary LTD, Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The range below reflects the expected base salary for this position. It represents a good-faith estimate of the base pay we anticipate offering, with actual compensation determined by your experience, education, skills, and performance throughout the interview process. This role is also eligible for a discretionary bonus (at DV Trading&#39;s discretion) and DV Trading&#39;s benefits package, including the benefits listed above.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

7913915003:
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AwkZdlAVioMuamxLKXxlBWKkghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;The Senior Growth Manager will own local growth strategy and end-to-end program delivery across product go-to-market, customer growth, and priority segments, including advanced traders and VIPs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior individual contributor role responsible for translating business and product priorities into coordinated growth initiatives and measurable commercial outcomes. The role will act as the key local stakeholder for global Performance Marketing and Lifecycle teams while working closely with Product, Relationship Management, Data, Marketing, and other regional and global stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own local growth initiatives end to end, from strategy and planning through execution, optimisation, and performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead go-to-market programs for priority products, defining target segments, customer journeys, messaging, incentives, channel plans, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop full-funnel growth strategies for advanced traders, VIPs, high-value customers, and other priority segments, driving funding, trading activity, product adoption, retention, revenue, and lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design loyalty, reward, engagement, and reactivation programs that support sustainable customer and commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the key local stakeholder for global Performance Marketing and Lifecycle teams, translating local priorities into campaign briefs and collaborating on audiences, customer journeys, creative and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute customer events, VIP experiences, partner activations, and industry engagements, managing delivery from objectives and budgets through to stakeholder coordination and post-event reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Data, Relationship Management, Marketing, Legal, Compliance, Risk, and Finance to deliver coordinated, compliant, and commercially sustainable growth programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor customer and commercial performance, identify growth opportunities, and communicate insights, results, and recommendations to local, regional, and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;56&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in growth marketing, product marketing, digital marketing, commercial growth, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing growth or go-to-market initiatives from strategy through execution and performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of customer segmentation, lifecycle growth, retention, reactivation, and monetisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Basic understanding of paid-media and lifecycle-marketing principles, with the ability to brief and collaborate effectively with specialist teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Experience planning and executing customer events, VIP engagements, partner activations, or industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Strong commercial and analytical skills, with the ability to connect growth activities to customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Proven ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders and work effectively with regional and global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Strong communication, stakeholder-management, and project-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Proactive, execution-focused, and comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Experience in cryptocurrency, fintech, financial services, or another regulated industry is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Experience working with sophiscated investors, institution, VIPs, loyalty programs, affiliates, or high-value customer segments is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
