&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ks0kd3OsKocNISxwloVl6a7CgLd&quot;&gt;This role offers the chance to drive OKX’s growth in the MENA region by acquiring new VIP clients while building long-term relationships with our existing high-value client base. You will play a key part in shaping and executing our regional VIP strategy, expanding OKX’s footprint across the local market and working closely with regional and global growth, product, and business intelligence teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
