&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, scale, and complexity, opening new ways to leverage blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets, and it is trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fireblocks, security isn’t an afterthought; it’s the foundation of everything we do&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Making Security Real&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Information Security Engineer, you’ll be on the front lines of protecting the systems, users, and data at scale. This role is about turning strategy, architecture, and intent into enforced controls, effective detections, and resilient operations. You’ll work hands-on with the tools, signals, and incidents that define our real security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you believe security should be practical, measurable, and embedded into daily operations—and not just documented—we want you on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What the Role Looks Like in Practice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the technical anchor of our internal security posture:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architectural Ownership: Deploy, manage, and tune enterprise-grade security stacks (EDR, DLP, IAM, CASB, MDM) with a focus on deep integration and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The AI Frontier: Lead the charge on AI Security. You will implement and secure AI-driven workflows, ensuring LLM use is governed and protected against emerging threats such as data leakage and prompt injection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive Defense: Build and maintain high-fidelity detections and guardrails that align with real-world attack techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Synergy: Partner as a peer with Engineering, IT, and DevOps to ensure security controls are frictionless, automated, and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Must-Haves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ Years of Experience: Extensive hands-on experience in InfoSec Engineering or SecOps within high-growth, cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Security Mastery (Required): You are ahead of the curve. You have practical experience securing AI adoption and leveraging AI-driven platforms to scale defensive capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Technical Stack: Expert-level knowledge of endpoint security (macOS/Linux), SaaS ecosystems, and Identity (Okta/OIDC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Developer Mindset: Advanced scripting skills (Python is a must) to automate away manual toil and build custom security integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional &amp;amp; Interpersonal Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Communication: The ability to articulate complex technical risks as actionable business intelligence for diverse stakeholders, ensuring alignment between security objectives and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Influence: A track record of fostering strong partnerships with R&amp;amp;D and DevOps. You are a facilitator of &quot;Secure-by-Design&quot; principles, focused on engineering solutions rather than creating administrative bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crisis Management &amp;amp; Decisiveness: The capacity to maintain operational composure during high-stakes incidents, applying rigorous prioritization and risk-based analysis to drive remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic Professionalism: A disciplined approach to balancing theoretical security ideals with the functional requirements of a high-velocity, global financial infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4699779006:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform delivering a secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. At Fireblocks, we enable businesses to securely build, run and scale digital asset operations through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure. Our next-generation multi-layer technology protects Digital assets from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error. Fireblocks is the only platform that provides insurance for digital assets in storage, transfer, and E&amp;amp;O.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of August 2025, we serve over 2400 institutional customers, have secured the transfer of over $10 trillion in digital assets, and are the world&#39;s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: Enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;4:1-4:18;51-68&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;6:1-6:405;70-474&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to join a fast-growing team and drive sales growth across Asia Pacific. You&#39;ll work closely with regional sales teams and leadership to build a marketing strategy spanning both online and offline tactics to generate pipeline and revenue across the region. You&#39;ll partner with a wide range of cross-functional teams and take ownership of executing and managing all marketing activity in APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;8:1-8:18;476-493&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-18:102;495-1287&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:91;495-585&quot;&gt;Plan and execute field marketing programs that generate pipeline for the APAC sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:125;586-710&quot;&gt;Partner with key internal stakeholders to build and implement a go-to-market strategy combining online and offline tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:73;711-783&quot;&gt;Lead the strategy and execution of custom virtual and in-person events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:53;784-836&quot;&gt;Report on marketing activity and the ROI it drives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:103;837-939&quot;&gt;Build deep expertise in the region and industry — regulations, key players, and areas of opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:63;940-1002&quot;&gt;Translate sales priorities into effective marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:80;1003-1082&quot;&gt;Become the go-to marketing partner for the Sales and Account Management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:103;1083-1185&quot;&gt;Build relationships with customers and partners to surface new opportunities that benefit both sides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:26;1289-1314&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-29:26;1331-1828&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:34;1331-1364&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:141;1365-1505&quot;&gt;5+ years of B2B marketing experience in SaaS, Fintech, or Cyber Security, with solid understanding of channel and funnel marketing tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:74;1506-1579&quot;&gt;Proven experience running marketing programs end-to-end across a region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:139;1580-1718&quot;&gt;Agile, with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, complex environment that demands multitasking, transparency, and sharp prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:139;1580-1718&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with HubSpot, Salesforce, Google Analytics, and Google Ads, plus email marketing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:139;1580-1718&quot;&gt;Campaign management experience: budget ownership and the ability to define, build, optimize, and refine channel campaigns end-to-end (strategy, offers, design, messaging, segmentation, and creative)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:139;1580-1718&quot;&gt;Background in crypto / blockchain is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:139;1580-1718&quot;&gt;Fluency in a regional language in addition to English&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’d love for you to have financial services, fintech, blockchain, cybersecurity or crypto industry experience but it is not a requirement. We have a comprehensive onboarding and training program for all new employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4951144101:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs&quot; data-eleid=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs&quot; data-eleid=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;We are looking for a seasoned data strategist to lead and build the Data Strategy Group (DSG) within DSG — a 3-person team responsible for sourcing, negotiating, integrating, and maintaining external data streams that power Index Pricing Calculations. This is a hands-on leadership role combining commercial data partnership expertise with technical understanding, owning the full data lifecycle from source identification through ongoing operations and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate has a background in data sourcing strategy within a trading firm, exchange, or financial data business — someone who understands how to identify unique and valuable data streams, negotiate commercial terms, and operationalize them at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Data Source Strategy &amp;amp; Discovery&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Define and execute the data sourcing strategy aligned with DSG&#39;s Index Pricing roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Identify and evaluate candidate data streams — market data vendors, exchanges, alternative data providers, OTC desks, and novel/non-traditional sources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a scoring framework assessing coverage, latency, reliability, cost, uniqueness, and licensing terms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Conduct proof-of-concept evaluations with shortlisted vendors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Maintain a continuous pipeline of potential future data sources to stay ahead of market developments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Commercial Negotiation &amp;amp; Vendor Partnerships&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end pricing and contract negotiations with data vendors and partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Structure licensing agreements covering redistribution rights, usage scope, derived data permissions, and audit clauses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Negotiate SLAs for uptime, latency, data correction policies, and support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Manage renewals, amendments, and terminations; benchmark pricing against market rates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain long-term strategic relationships with key data partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;Own the full commercial relationship with all data vendors post-signature&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Technical Connectivity &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;Oversee the design and implementation of data ingestion pipelines (APIs, feeds, FTP, WebSocket, FIX, streaming protocols)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Coordinate with vendors on connectivity requirements (VPNs, cross-connects, credentialing)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;Ensure normalization and validation layers meet Index Pricing quality standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;Work closely with the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Big Data Team&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure data is archived per retention policies and available for downstream analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;Maintain integration documentation and operational runbooks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Data Monitoring &amp;amp; Quality Assurance&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;Establish and oversee automated monitoring for data reliability (staleness, gaps, anomalies)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;Ensure regular soundness checks (statistical validation, cross-source reconciliation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;Define alerting thresholds and escalation procedures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;Produce periodic health reports for stakeholders; track vendor SLA adherence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;License &amp;amp; Compliance Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;Maintain a complete registry of data license agreements, terms, and obligations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;Ensure all reporting requirements are met (usage reports, redistribution disclosures, audit responses)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;Guarantee internal usage remains within contractual scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;Manage vendor audits and information requests&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;Flag renewals and renegotiation windows with minimum 90 days advance notice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;Hire, mentor, and develop the two other DSG team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;Set team priorities and delivery cadence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;Foster a documentation-first, cross-trained culture to mitigate single-point-of-failure risk&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;This role works closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Logic&lt;/strong&gt; — Pricing methodology alignment, calculation logic inputs, model validation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Innovation&lt;/strong&gt; — New product requirements driving data needs, feature collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Risk&lt;/strong&gt; — Risk model data inputs, quality requirements for risk calculations, stress testing data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Big Data Team&lt;/strong&gt; — Data archival, storage infrastructure, historical backfills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Legal / Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; — Contract review, regulatory guidance, license interpretation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/strong&gt; — Budget management, cost tracking, vendor payments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technology / Infra&lt;/strong&gt; — Network connectivity, security review, environment provisioning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
