&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Ym8edZjm2oXI73x8gfZlDIsIgBh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ss7KdvlYNohEG5xqkr6lH42Sgnh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Ym8edZjm2oXI73x8gfZlDIsIgBh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZNXhdwdQ2omhVyxzg5KlREsggMh&quot;&gt;Singapore based, we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager – AI Risk Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the evolution of OKX Buy/Sell Crypto risk control capabilities. You will own the end-to-end risk strategy across transaction risk, fraud prevention, review operations and AI-powered decision making.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;At OKX, you will have the opportunity to build next-generation AI-native risk systems that protect millions of users worldwide. You will play a key role in redefining how AI Agents, Large Language Models and intelligent decision engines transform fraud prevention and operational efficiency across one of the world&#39;s leading crypto platforms. This role is highly data-driven and requires strong ownership. You will independently analyze risk data, identify fraud patterns, design and optimize risk strategies, and drive the transformation from traditional manual review to AI Agent-powered intelligent review. You will work closely with Engineering and Risk Operations teams to build scalable, intelligent and efficient risk systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEUbd7sWzobkyGxnNNAufQyQsXe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Ym8edZjm2oXI73x8gfZlDIsIgBh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RaBgdgKWCoBeXyxwjgzlLOL8gU1&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end risk strategy for Buy/Sell Crypto products, including transaction risk control, fraud prevention, review workflows and decision engines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPZhd9KSnoyRjKxXZ1Ul9u7ygHc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and continuously optimize the risk control architecture, including rule engines, policy engines, model orchestration and review systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WA9nd8IgqobyQBxI01tlXPazgvh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Independently analyze large-scale transaction and risk data to identify fraud patterns, emerging attack vectors and strategy optimization opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WJrIdhpsRodmxRxmx8ylBUmOgqg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design, implement and iterate risk policies based on data-driven insights to improve fraud detection while minimizing user friction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QdmsdXSBBoUw0txFpkllFI3Fgmc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define and optimize model policies, decision thresholds, confidence scores and human-in-the-loop review mechanisms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YHFMdJnvKoERbCxC5WVlXC96gXc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct root cause analysis, monitor risk performance and perform A/B testing to continuously improve strategy effectiveness.&lt;/div&gt;
