&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;About This Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;We are building the next-generation Financial Cloud platform, enabling Bybit to deploy and operate regulated financial services across 50+ global sites, each subject to different compliance requirements (EU MiCA, APAC licenses, etc.). Each site is a unique combination of business modules, infrastructure configurations, and compliance controls — managed as versioned, reproducible units.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;As a Senior DevOps Engineer for the Financial Cloud Toolchain, you will drive the end-to-end developer experience and deployment automation for this multi-site platform. You will design and build systems that ensure every deployment is reproducible, every dependency is traceable, and every site automatically and safely converges to its declared state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Build &amp;amp; Release Engineering (40%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
