&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GV3ddpMvMoPzMRxXCwblEY21gje&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VGkGdbYbVoyk52xZrTYlqnuigdd&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
