&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TH94dRKJdoko82xuCzjuH0dyscR&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong organisational, project coordination and stakeholder management skills with excellent attention to detail.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QIPvdn8e7oFFl4x0CFiuUhkiskd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to develop clear SOPs, process documentation and management reports.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OK92dbAyDojJfJxmloPuQCxxs2e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable working independently in a fast-paced environment with competing priorities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcFAdMgxhopiDvxuUjWuHs2qsYb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Crypto or digital asset experience is advantageous but not essential.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYrYdsgskoCDTZx2IFDuvJBEsLf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluency in English (written and spoken) is required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KcVbd3tu0owjNBxYwVPurIQBsgh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mandarin proficiency is advantageous to support collaboration with Mandarin-speaking stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FBEgdH4tcoFOjaxe89zueXxlszb&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-On9NdF2NZoNjXyxF2pIuZOrfsdW&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Passionate about cryptocurrency and financial innovation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYp1dFZVboDcmSxFTLCuLW7NsPb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
