&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee the day-to-day finance operations and end-to-end accounting for assigned entities, covering transaction booking, payment and expense review, and cash monitoring.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the monthly, quarterly and annual financial close, ensuring journal entries, accruals, reconciliations and reporting schedules are completed accurately and on time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prepare and review management accounts, statutory financial statements, Group reporting packages and variance analyses in accordance with IFRS/HKFRS and Group policies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Reconcile bank, exchange, wallet, digital asset, trading and intercompany balances, and coordinate with relevant teams to investigate and resolve discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Coordinate with internal and external parties on accounting and reporting matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Handle statutory audits and tax reporting for assigned entities, including the preparation of audit schedules and timely responses to enquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Maintain effective financial controls and accounting documentation, drive process improvements and automation, and support new business initiatives and ad hoc projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gy4ydICWpol34Hxzjdhu4zdVshg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
