&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Degree in Accounting, Finance or a related discipline, or a recognised professional accounting qualification such as HKICPA, ACCA, CPA or equivalent.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Minimum 7 years of relevant experience in financial accounting, reporting, audit or finance operations; Big 4 and commercial experience in financial services, fintech or digital assets are preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong hands-on experience in financial close, multi-entity reporting, balance sheet reconciliations, statutory audits and management reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
