&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with excellent attention to detail and a high level of ownership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to work independently, manage multiple priorities and deliver under tight reporting deadlines in a dynamic and fast-paced environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Excel; experience with Oracle, ERP systems or data analytics tools is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
