&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OqGZdUPi6oJlXzxlmNiu3gAmsVg&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Hong Kong, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusq2WnfR822THsuqUosdSzFu&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;LP3ndFXkVoJ3HGxXusllZLOPgLh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgKMpWHkLeeDn9JN9XgsLjFc&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands-on product manager to drive growth across our platform&#39;s trading and asset business — spot, perpetuals, TradFi, and beyond. You&#39;ll ship the product features behind our growth programs, run the campaigns (including token-listing campaigns) that power them, and grow the trading volume and assets they generate — owning the full lifecycle from requirements and delivery through launch, execution, data, and iteration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;LP3ndFXkVoJ3HGxXusllZLOPgLh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgX7UYE716xLuJ9vfX4dik6d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive product feature delivery.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end delivery of related product features — requirement grooming, UI/UX reviews, tracking dev and QA progress, and launch acceptance — to ship on time and at high quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVI6rbLqqCA4JmMUK8OoZFm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run campaigns end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; Set up, configure, and manage the full lifecycle of marketing campaigns — including token-listing campaigns, new-token Staking, and related Campaigns — ensuring each integrates smoothly with the underlying product features.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgeLWy0vchOXvb8KaJad9tHg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow trading volume and assets through campaigns.&lt;/strong&gt; Use campaigns and incentives to grow trading volume across the platform&#39;s asset categories (spot, perpetuals, TradFi); design and rapidly iterate growth mechanics with clear hypotheses, validate them against real data, and tailor the lever to each category&#39;s users and mechanics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgsf22XtcYb62jzpL87eDloe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own channel &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;attribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; and analysis.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain channel attribution — breaking trading volume down by channel, campaign, and incentive — and use data analysis to run volume breakdowns, channel ROI, and user segmentation to find the highest-leverage opportunities and guide resource allocation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgmQdgEVce6JQAsFgCBJbAMb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor and optimize.&lt;/strong&gt; Track real-time data during launches and campaigns — user engagement and conversion funnels — respond quickly to anomalies and risk-control alerts, and produce regular retrospective reports.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
